    editTier: "bestseller",
    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Nuclei SV Parka", "bodyKo": "Serious cold requires serious warmth. Packable, light, and efficient, the Nuclei SV is our warmest synthetically insulated belay parka. Varying layers of Coreloft™ insulation are strategically placed to provide maximum warmth while keeping weight down, and the light, tough Arato™ 15 shell is breathable, windproof, and repels light moisture. Three external and two internal pockets keep essentials at hand, and the helmet compatible StormHood™ protects without impeding vision.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009870/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009870/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Moisture-resistant outer face fabric · Windproof · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable · Wind resistant · Packable · Warm and comfortable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009870/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Two layers of Coreloft™ Continuous insulation at front, back, and upper arms for added warmth · Single layer of Coreloft™ Continuous insulation at underarms, lower arm, sides, and hood for breathable warmth · Mapping strategically places different weights of synthetic insulation to maximize warmth and climate control", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009870/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "스트레치 니트 소맷단", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009870/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "의류 센터백 길이: S 사이즈는 28\"/72cm - 사이즈에 따라 다릅니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009870/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "DWR(내구성 발수) 마감으로 습기를 차단합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009870/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009870/black/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "헬멧과 호환되는 StormHood™는 가시성에 영향을 주지 않고 완전한 커버리지를 제공합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009870/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "통합된 기능", "bodyKo": "Includes stuff sack with webbing loop to clip to a harness", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009870/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Two hand pockets with zippers · Chest pocket · Two internal dump pockets", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009870/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Lining - bluepass Material, recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant · Shell - dope dyed some colours", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009870/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "기술적 특징: Moisture-resistant outer face fabric · Windproof · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable · Wind resistant · Packable · Warm and comfortable", "구조: Two layers of Coreloft™ Continuous insulation at front, back, and upper arms for added warmth · Single layer of Coreloft™ Continuous insulation at underarms, lower arm, sides, and hood for breathable warmth · Mapping strategically places different weights of synthetic insulation to maximize warmth and climate control", "밑단 및 소매 구성: 스트레치 니트 소맷단", "디자인 및 핏: 의류 센터백 길이: S 사이즈는 28\"/72cm - 사이즈에 따라 다릅니다.", "원단 처리: DWR(내구성 발수) 마감으로 습기를 차단합니다.", "밑단 구성: 조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "후드 구성: 헬멧과 호환되는 StormHood™는 가시성에 영향을 주지 않고 완전한 커버리지를 제공합니다.", "통합된 기능: Includes stuff sack with webbing loop to clip to a harness", "포켓 구성: Two hand pockets with zippers · Chest pocket · Two internal dump pockets", "지속 가능성: Lining - bluepass Material, recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant · Shell - dope dyed some colours", "소재: Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™ Continuous 90 (90 g/m²) - 100% Polyester · Lining: Pertex® Diamond Fuse 20d ripstop, downproof, FC0 DWR, 38gsm - 100% Nylon · Body: 20d/8f N6 Dope Dyed, 25D/5f Vectran Twist 250Z TPM, 39gsm, FC0 DWR + Acrylic Coated - 93% Nylon, 7% Polyarylate · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash low · Tumble dry normal low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse · Front load washer recommended · Use mesh bag for top load washer", "핏: Regular"],
