    editTier: "bestseller",
    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Cerium SV Hoody", "bodyKo": "역대 가장 따뜻하고 내구성이 뛰어난 Cerium 다운 후디. 극한의 추위에서 독립형으로 사용하도록 제작된 하이 로프트 1000필 구스 다운은 습기가 많은 지역에서 활용되는 Coreloft™를 통해 가볍고 휴대 가능한 단열 기능을 제공합니다. 100% 재활용된 20D Pertex® Diamond Fuse 외부는 가볍고 방풍 기능이 있으며 무게를 추가하지 않고도 내구성을 높이는 다이아몬드 필라멘트 구조를 갖추고 있습니다. 단열 StormHood는 따뜻함을 확장하고 주변 시력을 유지하는 데 도움이 되는 편안하고 안전한 핏을 조정합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010558/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010558/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Moisture-resistant outer face fabric · Breathable · Great warmth-to-weight ratio · Lightweight · Compressible and packable · Durable · Wind resistant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010558/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Ultra-lofty premium 1000 fill grey goose down delivers exceptional warmth for its weight · Downproof 20D plant-based Arato™ liner is exceptionally lightweight and reduces petroleum use · Down Composite Mapping™ strategically places 100% recycled polyester Coreloft™ Silver synthetic insulation in moisture-prone areas · Windproof, downproof 20D Pertex® Diamond Fuse mini-ripstop outer is made from 100% recycled nylon and utilizes a unique diamond-filament construction for durability", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010558/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Regular fit provides freedom of movement · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 27\"/68cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010558/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010558/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "단열 헬멧과 호환되는 StormHood™", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010558/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "통합된 기능", "bodyKo": "컴팩트하게 운반할 수 있는 물건 자루 포함", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010558/black/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010558/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Two hand pockets with zippers · Chest pocket · Two internal dump pockets", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010558/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Padding - bluepass Material, recycled content · RDS (Responsible Down Standard) - 100% of our down is certified to the RDS by IDFL (No.TE-99950273) · Feather - This product contains feather not exceeding that allowable by law · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant · Lining - FC0 DWR · Shell - recycled content, FC0 DWR, bluepass Material", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010558/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Lining: 10D x 20D Ripstop - 100% Nylon · Down Insulation: 1000 fill grey goose down, min 90/10, RDS - 100% Grey Goose Down (minimum 90% down) · Body: Pertex® Diamond Fuse 20d ripstop, downproof, FC0 DWR, 38gsm - 100% Nylon · Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™, 40gsm - 100% Polyester · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010558/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "기술적 특징: Moisture-resistant outer face fabric · Breathable · Great warmth-to-weight ratio · Lightweight · Compressible and packable · Durable · Wind resistant", "구조: Ultra-lofty premium 1000 fill grey goose down delivers exceptional warmth for its weight · Downproof 20D plant-based Arato™ liner is exceptionally lightweight and reduces petroleum use · Down Composite Mapping™ strategically places 100% recycled polyester Coreloft™ Silver synthetic insulation in moisture-prone areas · Windproof, downproof 20D Pertex® Diamond Fuse mini-ripstop outer is made from 100% recycled nylon and utilizes a unique diamond-filament construction for durability", "디자인 및 핏: Regular fit provides freedom of movement · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 27\"/68cm - Varies by size", "밑단 구성: 조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "후드 구성: 단열 헬멧과 호환되는 StormHood™", "통합된 기능: 컴팩트하게 운반할 수 있는 물건 자루 포함", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "포켓 구성: Two hand pockets with zippers · Chest pocket · Two internal dump pockets", "지속 가능성: Padding - bluepass Material, recycled content · RDS (Responsible Down Standard) - 100% of our down is certified to the RDS by IDFL (No.TE-99950273) · Feather - This product contains feather not exceeding that allowable by law · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant · Lining - FC0 DWR · Shell - recycled content, FC0 DWR, bluepass Material", "소재: Lining: 10D x 20D Ripstop - 100% Nylon · Down Insulation: 1000 fill grey goose down, min 90/10, RDS - 100% Grey Goose Down (minimum 90% down) · Body: Pertex® Diamond Fuse 20d ripstop, downproof, FC0 DWR, 38gsm - 100% Nylon · Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™, 40gsm - 100% Polyester · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash gentle low · Tumble dry gentle low · Tumble dry low with tennis balls · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse · Front load washer recommended · Use mesh bag for top load washer", "핏: Regular"],
