    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Sentinel Insulated Jacket", "bodyKo": "Built for freeride, but also a go-to for racking up on-area laps, the Sentinel Insulated Jacket’s warmth and weather protection helps you stay on the snow – comfortably – all day. Durable, lightweight 80D 3L ePE GORE-TEX fabric is waterproof, windproof and breathable. 100% recycled Coreloft™ Compact insulation keeps you warm. The insulated helmet-compatible StormHood provides extra storm coverage, powder skirt seals out snow, and an embedded RECCO® reflector can aid search and rescue.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010538/aster-black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010538/aster-black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010538/aster-black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Coreloft™ Compact insulation regulates temperature, performs if wet, and is made from 100% recycled materials · PFAS-free GORE-TEX® ePE with a recycled face delivers complete waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · 80D ePE SSD (Soft Shell Dope Dyed) - flannel backer for added comfort", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010538/aster-black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Regular fit provides freedom of movement with room for layers · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 31\"/79cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010538/aster-black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "DWR(내구성 발수) 마감으로 습기를 차단합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010538/aster-black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "단열 헬멧과 호환되는 StormHood™", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010538/aster-black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010538/aster-black/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Internal mesh dump pocket · Internal zippered pocket · Two insulated hand pockets with zippers · Sleeve pocket for RFID pass", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010538/aster-black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "스노우스포츠 기능", "bodyKo": "RECCO® reflector aids search and rescue in emergency situations · Slide 'n Loc™ attachment fits compatible pants and jackets to form a unified system that seals out snow · Integrated powder skirt seals out snow", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010538/aster-black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지퍼 및 플라이 구성", "bodyKo": "쉬운 통풍을 위한 구덩이 지퍼", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010538/aster-black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Lining: 20D recycled dope dyed nylon ripstop, FC0 DWR, 38gsm - 100% Nylon · Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™ Compact, 80gsm - 100% Polyester · Body: 80d 3L GORE-TEX® ePE with C-KNIT™ backer, plain weave recycled nylon, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010538/aster-black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable", "구조: Coreloft™ Compact insulation regulates temperature, performs if wet, and is made from 100% recycled materials · PFAS-free GORE-TEX® ePE with a recycled face delivers complete waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · 80D ePE SSD (Soft Shell Dope Dyed) - flannel backer for added comfort", "디자인 및 핏: Regular fit provides freedom of movement with room for layers · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 31\"/79cm - Varies by size", "원단 처리: DWR(내구성 발수) 마감으로 습기를 차단합니다.", "후드 구성: 단열 헬멧과 호환되는 StormHood™", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "포켓 구성: Internal mesh dump pocket · Internal zippered pocket · Two insulated hand pockets with zippers · Sleeve pocket for RFID pass", "스노우스포츠 기능: RECCO® reflector aids search and rescue in emergency situations · Slide 'n Loc™ attachment fits compatible pants and jackets to form a unified system that seals out snow · Integrated powder skirt seals out snow", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: 쉬운 통풍을 위한 구덩이 지퍼", "소재: Lining: 20D recycled dope dyed nylon ripstop, FC0 DWR, 38gsm - 100% Nylon · Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™ Compact, 80gsm - 100% Polyester · Body: 80d 3L GORE-TEX® ePE with C-KNIT™ backer, plain weave recycled nylon, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash permanent press medium · Tumble dry permanent press low · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Front load washer recommended · Use mesh bag for top load washer", "핏: Regular"],
