    editTier: "bestseller",
    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Liatris Down Jacket", "bodyKo": "The versatile Liatris has a focused purpose – keeping you warm and dry – and utilizes advanced design and premium materials to do it. The 70D 3L GORE-TEX shuts out wind, rain, and snow and has C-KNIT™ backer technology for added softness and breathability. The light, lofty 850 fill European goose down insulates and is held in place with a unique stitch-free bonded baffle technology for added durability. The warm hood and insulated collar hold the heat, and multiple pockets provide storage.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009859/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Relaxed", "bodyKo": "This fit is cut loosely through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Relaxed without sacrificing structure and clean lines, it offers comfort and freedom of movement with a more casual look.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009859/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009859/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "GORE-TEX® three-layer construction delivers complete weather protection · GORE C-KNIT™ backer technology is light, soft and comfortable · Stitch-free bonded baffle construction adds durability, improves GORE-TEX® integrity · Down Composite Mapping™ combines down with strategic use of Coreloft™ synthetic insulation in moisture-prone areas · Lofty 850 fill European grey goose down delivers exceptional warmth for its weight and is RDS (Responsible Down Standard) certified", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009859/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "Internal sleeve gasket seals out drafts", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009859/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Relaxed fit for comfort and easy layering · Longer length for additional coverage · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 30\"/75cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009859/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "Fully adjustable insulated hood provides full coverage and has an integrated insulated collar for added warmth", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009859/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009859/black/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Two chest pockets with zippers · Note: Our WaterTight™ zippers are highly water resistant, but not waterproof. We do not recommend keeping items in your pockets that may be damaged by moisture · Dual-entry, insulated hand pockets with brushed lining provide warmth and storage · Two internal dump pockets, one with secure internal pocket, hold gloves or toque", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009859/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Shell - bluepass Material, dope dyed backer, recycled content · Lining - recycled content · RDS (Responsible Down Standard) - 100% of our down is certified to the RDS by IDFL (No.TE-99950273) · Feather - This product contains feather not exceeding that allowable by law · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009859/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지퍼 및 플라이 구성", "bodyKo": "전면 전체 지퍼", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009859/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Down Insulation: 850 fill European grey goose down, min 90/10, RDS - 100% Grey Goose Down (minimum 90% down) · Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™ Continuous 90 (90 g/m²) - 100% Polyester · Lining: 15d recycled N6 microrip, downproof, 34gsm - 100% Nylon · Body: 80d 3L GORE-TEX® ePE with C-KNIT™ backer, plain weave recycled nylon, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane · Self: 3L GORE-TEX® with GORE C-KNIT™ backer technology: 100% nylon face - bluesign Approved Material · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009859/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Relaxed: This fit is cut loosely through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Relaxed without sacrificing structure and clean lines, it offers comfort and freedom of movement with a more casual look.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable", "구조: GORE-TEX® three-layer construction delivers complete weather protection · GORE C-KNIT™ backer technology is light, soft and comfortable · Stitch-free bonded baffle construction adds durability, improves GORE-TEX® integrity · Down Composite Mapping™ combines down with strategic use of Coreloft™ synthetic insulation in moisture-prone areas · Lofty 850 fill European grey goose down delivers exceptional warmth for its weight and is RDS (Responsible Down Standard) certified", "밑단 및 소매 구성: Internal sleeve gasket seals out drafts", "디자인 및 핏: Relaxed fit for comfort and easy layering · Longer length for additional coverage · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 30\"/75cm - Varies by size", "후드 구성: Fully adjustable insulated hood provides full coverage and has an integrated insulated collar for added warmth", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "포켓 구성: Two chest pockets with zippers · Note: Our WaterTight™ zippers are highly water resistant, but not waterproof. We do not recommend keeping items in your pockets that may be damaged by moisture · Dual-entry, insulated hand pockets with brushed lining provide warmth and storage · Two internal dump pockets, one with secure internal pocket, hold gloves or toque", "지속 가능성: Shell - bluepass Material, dope dyed backer, recycled content · Lining - recycled content · RDS (Responsible Down Standard) - 100% of our down is certified to the RDS by IDFL (No.TE-99950273) · Feather - This product contains feather not exceeding that allowable by law · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: 전면 전체 지퍼", "소재: Down Insulation: 850 fill European grey goose down, min 90/10, RDS - 100% Grey Goose Down (minimum 90% down) · Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™ Continuous 90 (90 g/m²) - 100% Polyester · Lining: 15d recycled N6 microrip, downproof, 34gsm - 100% Nylon · Body: 80d 3L GORE-TEX® ePE with C-KNIT™ backer, plain weave recycled nylon, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane · Self: 3L GORE-TEX® with GORE C-KNIT™ backer technology: 100% nylon face - bluesign Approved Material · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash low · Tumble dry low with tennis balls · Tumble dry permanent press low · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Front load washer recommended · Use mesh bag for top load washer", "핏: Relaxed"],
