    registeredAt: "2026-07-31T17:42:42.000Z",
    editTier: "bestseller",
    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Norvan Insulated Hoody", "bodyKo": "가장 가볍고 휴대성이 가장 뛰어난 합성 단열 후드티는 추운 겨울 러닝 시에도 편안함을 유지합니다. Fortius Air 20 페이스 패브릭은 공기 흐름과 바람 저항의 균형을 맞추고 PFAS가 없는 DWR 처리로 물을 밀어냅니다. 전면, 측면 및 슬리브 Insulated체에 25gsm Coreloft가 매핑되어 있습니다. 유선형 후드가 보호 기능을 추가하고, 러닝 전용 관절로 자유롭게 움직일 수 있으며, 지퍼가 달린 포켓이 튕김 방지 보관 기능을 제공하고, 소매에 집어넣을 수 있는 플립 미트가 손을 따뜻하게 유지해 줍니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008528/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏: 슬림 핏", "bodyKo": "Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008528/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Moisture-resistant outer face fabric · Breathable · Lightweight · Compressible and packable · Wind resistant · Air permeable · Warm and comfortable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008528/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Fortius™ Air 20 face fabric effectively balances air permeability and weather resistance with lightweight durability and stretch · Coreloft™ synthetic insulation provides warmth with minimal weight and bulk · Fortius™ Air 20 nylon liner is lightweight, breathable, and made with recycled content · Uninsulated underarm gussets and back panel provide enhanced ventilation", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008528/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Fitted for mobility and comfortable layering under the Norvan Shell · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 26\"/66cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008528/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008528/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "로우 프로파일 후드가 칼라 안으로 굴러갑니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008528/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "통합된 기능", "bodyKo": "Reflective elements increase visibility in low light · Integrated flip-mitts in sleeves warm the hands and tuck away unnoticed when not in use", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008528/black/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Pocket doubles as a stuff sack · Side pocket with invisible zipper", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008528/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Shell - bluepass Material · Lining - bluepass Material · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008528/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Synthetic Insulation: 25gsm stretch polyester fibrefill insulation - 100% Polyester · Lining: 20d nylon plain weave - 100% Nylon · Body: Fortius™ Air 20 - Plain Weave, FC0 DWR, 58gsm - 88% Nylon, 12% Elastane · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008528/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "관리 방법", "bodyKo": "Machine wash low · Tumble dry gentle low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse · Front load washer recommended · Use mesh bag for top load washer", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008528/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["핏: 슬림 핏: Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "기술적 특징: Moisture-resistant outer face fabric · Breathable · Lightweight · Compressible and packable · Wind resistant · Air permeable · Warm and comfortable", "구조: Fortius™ Air 20 face fabric effectively balances air permeability and weather resistance with lightweight durability and stretch · Coreloft™ synthetic insulation provides warmth with minimal weight and bulk · Fortius™ Air 20 nylon liner is lightweight, breathable, and made with recycled content · Uninsulated underarm gussets and back panel provide enhanced ventilation", "디자인 및 핏: Fitted for mobility and comfortable layering under the Norvan Shell · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 26\"/66cm - Varies by size", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "후드 구성: 로우 프로파일 후드가 칼라 안으로 굴러갑니다.", "통합된 기능: Reflective elements increase visibility in low light · Integrated flip-mitts in sleeves warm the hands and tuck away unnoticed when not in use", "포켓 구성: Pocket doubles as a stuff sack · Side pocket with invisible zipper", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Shell - bluepass Material · Lining - bluepass Material · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "소재: Synthetic Insulation: 25gsm stretch polyester fibrefill insulation - 100% Polyester · Lining: 20d nylon plain weave - 100% Nylon · Body: Fortius™ Air 20 - Plain Weave, FC0 DWR, 58gsm - 88% Nylon, 12% Elastane · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash low · Tumble dry gentle low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse · Front load washer recommended · Use mesh bag for top load washer", "핏: 슬림 핏"],
