    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Sentinel Jacket", "bodyKo": "Built for the vertical aspects of big mountain skiing, the rugged, comfortable Sentinel Jacket is a freeride legend. Durable, breathable 80D 3L ePE GORE-TEX seals out the elements and has a warm backer for soft comfort. The progressive design and ergonomic patterning remove restriction, WaterTight pit zips ventilate, and the helmet-compatible StormHood adjusts for full coverage and exceptional visibility. Large pockets are secure and accessible, and a RECCO® reflector can aid search and rescue. This product is free of intentionally added PFAS. The new ePE membrane technology is lighter and thinner, but just as strong and durable as the materials we used before. You may notice the face fabric “wetting out” slightly faster in products with ePE membranes, but rest assured this does not affect the waterproofing of the membrane itself. If you notice the fabric wetting out faster than you’d like, simply wash the jacket and dry it to remove the oil contamination and bring the DWR back to its full power.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010539/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010539/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010539/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Flannel backer for light insulation · PFAS-free GORE-TEX® ePE with a recycled face delivers complete waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · 80D ePE SSD (Soft Shell Dope Dyed) - flannel backer for added comfort", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010539/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Regular fit provides freedom of movement with room for layers · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 28\"/70cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010539/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "DWR(내구성 발수) 마감으로 습기를 차단합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010539/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "Helmet compatible StormHood™ provides full coverage without impacting visibility · Adjustable StormHood™", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010539/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010539/black/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Two hand pockets with zippers · Internal mesh dump pocket · Internal zippered pocket · Sleeve pocket for RFID pass", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010539/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "스노우스포츠 기능", "bodyKo": "RECCO® reflector aids search and rescue in emergency situations · Slide 'n Loc™ attachment fits compatible pants and jackets to form a unified system that seals out snow · Integrated powder skirt seals out snow", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010539/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지퍼 및 플라이 구성", "bodyKo": "쉬운 통풍을 위한 구덩이 지퍼", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010539/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Body: 3L GORE-TEX® ePE, Beam Dyed, 80d plain weave recycled nylon, 165gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane, 100% Polyester Backing · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010539/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable", "구조: Flannel backer for light insulation · PFAS-free GORE-TEX® ePE with a recycled face delivers complete waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · 80D ePE SSD (Soft Shell Dope Dyed) - flannel backer for added comfort", "디자인 및 핏: Regular fit provides freedom of movement with room for layers · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 28\"/70cm - Varies by size", "원단 처리: DWR(내구성 발수) 마감으로 습기를 차단합니다.", "후드 구성: Helmet compatible StormHood™ provides full coverage without impacting visibility · Adjustable StormHood™", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "포켓 구성: Two hand pockets with zippers · Internal mesh dump pocket · Internal zippered pocket · Sleeve pocket for RFID pass", "스노우스포츠 기능: RECCO® reflector aids search and rescue in emergency situations · Slide 'n Loc™ attachment fits compatible pants and jackets to form a unified system that seals out snow · Integrated powder skirt seals out snow", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: 쉬운 통풍을 위한 구덩이 지퍼", "소재: Body: 3L GORE-TEX® ePE, Beam Dyed, 80d plain weave recycled nylon, 165gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane, 100% Polyester Backing · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash medium · Tumble dry normal medium · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Do not leave wet · Remove immediately", "핏: Regular"],
