    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Sima Jacket", "bodyKo": "Summer’s sun invites us to hike. It brings blue skies, longer days – and the realities of heat and damaging rays. The Sima is your shield. Ultralight, easily packed, and exceptionally breathable, it stays cool on hot days while delivering UPF 50+ protection. 100% recycled Diem™ stretch polyester dries fast and feels soft on your skin. A gill vent at the back increases airflow, the tall collar extends protection, and the jacket stuffs into its side pocket for easy transport.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010617/mallow/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010617/mallow/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Breathable · Quick-drying · Ultralight · Air permeable · Packable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010617/mallow/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "칼라 구성", "bodyKo": "긴 칼라", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010617/mallow/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Diem™ polyester dries fast, is lightweight, durable, highly breathable, and comfortable next-to-skin", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010617/mallow/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "Partial elastic on cuff secures the fit", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010617/mallow/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Regular fit provides freedom of movement · Gill vents at back allow airflow for increased breathability · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 24\"/61cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010617/mallow/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "신축성 있는 밑단으로 안정적인 핏 제공", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010617/arctic-silk/1.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010617/arctic-silk/2.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Stows away in its own pocket · Side pocket with invisible zipper", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010617/arctic-silk/3.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010617/arctic-silk/4.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "UPF 등급", "bodyKo": "UPF 50+, EN 13758-2, AS4399:2020, GB/T 18830-2009. 덮힌 부분만 보호됩니다. 사용하거나 늘어나거나 젖으면 보호 기능이 저하될 수 있습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010617/arctic-silk/5.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "기술적 특징: Breathable · Quick-drying · Ultralight · Air permeable · Packable", "칼라 구성: 긴 칼라", "구조: Diem™ polyester dries fast, is lightweight, durable, highly breathable, and comfortable next-to-skin", "밑단 및 소매 구성: Partial elastic on cuff secures the fit", "디자인 및 핏: Regular fit provides freedom of movement · Gill vents at back allow airflow for increased breathability · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 24\"/61cm - Varies by size", "밑단 구성: 신축성 있는 밑단으로 안정적인 핏 제공", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "포켓 구성: Stows away in its own pocket · Side pocket with invisible zipper", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "UPF 등급: UPF 50+, EN 13758-2, AS4399:2020, GB/T 18830-2009. 덮힌 부분만 보호됩니다. 사용하거나 늘어나거나 젖으면 보호 기능이 저하될 수 있습니다.", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: 전면 전체 지퍼", "소재: Lining: Warp knit mesh - 100% Polyester · Body: Diem™, 60D recycled polyester plain weave, 76gsm - 100% Polyester · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash low · Tumble dry normal low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Iron low · Do not use fabric softener", "핏: Regular"],
