    registeredAt: "2026-07-31T17:42:50.000Z",
    editTier: "bestseller",
    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Ski Guide Pant", "bodyKo": "When the job calls for an ultra-durable pant meant to go all day long, use this pant built specifically for mechanized guiding, patrollers, and mountain professionals. This highly durable, weatherproof pant has been updated to include 100D 3L GORE-TEX PRO ePE fabric free from intentionally added PFAS, a removable RECCO® reflector with a low-profile design, and a revised pocket configuration to maximize storage.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009231/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably under our regular and relaxed fit shells.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009231/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009231/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Exceptionally durable 3L GORE-TEX® PRO ePE with a recycled nylon face delivers waterproof, windproof, breathable protection and is free from intentionally added PFAS—all without adding a lot of weight", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009231/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Regular fit ensures optimal ventilation with comfort and mobility · Removable knee pads provide thermal and impact protection", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009231/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009231/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "Stretch woven powder cuff with gripper elastic and static cord adjustment helps seal out snow", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009231/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Maximized storage includes hand pockets, high-capacity thigh pockets with volume pleats, and a security sleeve and key clip inside the right thigh pocket", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009231/black/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지원군", "bodyKo": "TPU overlay at insteps guards against edge cuts and abrasion on lower legs", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009231/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "스노우스포츠 기능", "bodyKo": "RECCO® 반사경은 긴급 상황에서 수색 및 구조를 지원합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009231/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Shell - bluepass Material, dope dyed backer, recycled content · Lining - bluepass Material, recycled content · Dope dyed backer · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009231/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "허리 및 벨트 구성", "bodyKo": "Integrated, adjustable webbing waist belt · Adjustable, removable suspenders · Waist loops accommodate a rigger’s belt", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009231/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably under our regular and relaxed fit shells.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable", "구조: Exceptionally durable 3L GORE-TEX® PRO ePE with a recycled nylon face delivers waterproof, windproof, breathable protection and is free from intentionally added PFAS—all without adding a lot of weight", "디자인 및 핏: Regular fit ensures optimal ventilation with comfort and mobility · Removable knee pads provide thermal and impact protection", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "밑단 구성: Stretch woven powder cuff with gripper elastic and static cord adjustment helps seal out snow", "포켓 구성: Maximized storage includes hand pockets, high-capacity thigh pockets with volume pleats, and a security sleeve and key clip inside the right thigh pocket", "지원군: TPU overlay at insteps guards against edge cuts and abrasion on lower legs", "스노우스포츠 기능: RECCO® 반사경은 긴급 상황에서 수색 및 구조를 지원합니다.", "지속 가능성: Shell - bluepass Material, dope dyed backer, recycled content · Lining - bluepass Material, recycled content · Dope dyed backer · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "허리 및 벨트 구성: Integrated, adjustable webbing waist belt · Adjustable, removable suspenders · Waist loops accommodate a rigger’s belt", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: 지퍼 플라이 클로저", "소재: Lining: Recycled nylon/spandex stretch plain weave FC0 DWR, 138 gsm - 86% Nylon, 14% Elastane · Body: 100d 3L GORE-TEX® PRO ePE, recycled plain weave, 135 gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane 100% Nylon Backing · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash medium · Tumble dry normal medium · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Do not leave wet · Remove immediately", "핏: Regular"],
