    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable", "구조: GORE-TEX® PRO ePE fabric free from intentionally added PFAS provides lightweight, durable, waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · Recycled face fabric is durable in all conditions", "디자인 및 핏: Regular fit provides freedom of movement · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 28\"/71cm - Varies by size", "후드 구성: Helmet compatible StormHood™ provides full coverage without impacting visibility · Adjustable hood provides custom protection", "패터닝: 이동성과 편안함을 위한 스노우스포츠 전용 연결 패턴", "포켓 구성: Internal chest pocket · Two hand pockets with zippers · Chest pocket · Two internal dump pockets · Sleeve pocket for RFID pass", "스노우스포츠 기능: RECCO® 반사경은 긴급 상황에서 수색 및 구조를 지원합니다.", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant · Shell - recycled content, FC0 DWR, bluepass Material, dope dyed", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: Pit zippers for easy venting · WaterTight™ zippers", "소재: Contrast: 80D 3L GORE-TEX® PRO ePE, 131 gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane 100% Nylon Backing · Body: 3L GORE-TEX® Pro ePE, 80d recycled nylon, 131 gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane 100% Nylon Backing · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash medium · Tumble dry normal medium · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Do not leave wet · Remove immediately", "핏: Regular"],
