    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Ifora Coat", "bodyKo": "An essential for rainy city environments, the Ifora Coat is a distinctive overcoat design, updated with GORE-TEX waterproofing with ePE membrane. The robust design features an insulated and ponytail-compatible Veilance StormHood paired with rear vents for breathability, as well as a wind-resistant TerraTex insert to seal out drafts. Built for easy layering, the coat also features an articulated pattern for freedom of movement. What's been updated: GORE-TEX with ePE membrane is waterproof, breathable, and free from intentionally added PFAS.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009877/dark-cocoon/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Oversized", "bodyKo": "Our most generous fit is cut loosely throughout the entire body. Dropped shoulders and wide sleeves provide freedom of movement while offering drape and structure for a contemporary look.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009877/dark-cocoon/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009877/dark-cocoon/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "PFAS-free GORE-TEX® ePE with a recycled face delivers complete waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · Recycled GORE C-KNIT™ backer is quiet, soft next-to-skin, and highly breathable · Shell contains GRS (Global Recycled Standard) certified recycled nylon", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009877/dark-cocoon/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 42\"/108cm - Varies by size · Rear vent improves breathability, wind-resistant TerraTex™ insert seals out drafts · Layer-friendly fit", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009877/dark-cocoon/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "DWR(내구성 발수) 마감으로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009877/dark-cocoon/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "단열 Veilance StormHood™는 주변 시야에 영향을 주지 않고 전체 범위를 제공하며 포니테일과 호환됩니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009877/dark-cocoon/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Chest pocket with zip · Exterior pockets with exaggerated flap closures", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009877/dark-cocoon/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Dope dyed backer · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009877/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Body: 80d 3L GORE-TEX® ePE with C-KNIT™ backer, plain weave recycled nylon, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009877/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "관리 방법", "bodyKo": "Machine wash medium · Tumble dry normal medium · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Do not leave wet · Remove immediately", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009877/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏", "bodyKo": "Oversized", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009877/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Oversized: Our most generous fit is cut loosely throughout the entire body. Dropped shoulders and wide sleeves provide freedom of movement while offering drape and structure for a contemporary look.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable", "구조: PFAS-free GORE-TEX® ePE with a recycled face delivers complete waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · Recycled GORE C-KNIT™ backer is quiet, soft next-to-skin, and highly breathable · Shell contains GRS (Global Recycled Standard) certified recycled nylon", "디자인 및 핏: Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 42\"/108cm - Varies by size · Rear vent improves breathability, wind-resistant TerraTex™ insert seals out drafts · Layer-friendly fit", "원단 처리: DWR(내구성 발수) 마감으로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "후드 구성: 단열 Veilance StormHood™는 주변 시야에 영향을 주지 않고 전체 범위를 제공하며 포니테일과 호환됩니다.", "포켓 구성: Chest pocket with zip · Exterior pockets with exaggerated flap closures", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Dope dyed backer · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "소재: Body: 80d 3L GORE-TEX® ePE with C-KNIT™ backer, plain weave recycled nylon, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash medium · Tumble dry normal medium · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Do not leave wet · Remove immediately", "핏: Oversized"],
