    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Ski Guide Bib Pant", "bodyKo": "Leave it on from pre-dawn to pure dark and bring everything you have. This highly durable, weatherproof bib pant has been updated with GORE-TEX PRO ePE fabric free from intentionally added PFAS, a removable RECCO® reflector, and revised pocket configurations. Designed for mechanized guiding, patrollers, and mountain professionals, this pant is as durable as possible while maximizing on-body storage.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009232/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably under our regular and relaxed fit shells.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009232/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009232/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Exceptionally durable 3L GORE-TEX® PRO ePE with a recycled nylon face delivers waterproof, windproof, breathable protection and is free from intentionally added PFAS—all without adding a lot of weight · Softshell bib offers four-way performance stretch and extended protection from wind and snow", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009232/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Regular fit ensures optimal ventilation with comfort and mobility · Removable knee pads provide thermal and impact protection", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009232/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009232/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "Stretch woven powder cuff with gripper elastic and static cord adjustment helps seal out snow", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009232/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Maximized storage includes two large bib pockets with key clips, hand pockets, high-capacity thigh pockets with volume pleats, and a security sleeve and key clip inside the right thigh pocket", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009232/black/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지원군", "bodyKo": "TPU overlay at insteps guards against edge cuts and abrasion on lower legs", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009232/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "스노우스포츠 기능", "bodyKo": "RECCO® 반사경은 긴급 상황에서 수색 및 구조를 지원합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009232/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Shell - bluepass Material, dope dyed backer, recycled content · Contrast - bluepass Material, recycled content · Lining - bluepass Material, recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009232/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "허리 및 벨트 구성", "bodyKo": "Drop seat functions with suspenders attached · Waist loops accommodate a rigger’s belt", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009232/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably under our regular and relaxed fit shells.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable", "구조: Exceptionally durable 3L GORE-TEX® PRO ePE with a recycled nylon face delivers waterproof, windproof, breathable protection and is free from intentionally added PFAS—all without adding a lot of weight · Softshell bib offers four-way performance stretch and extended protection from wind and snow", "디자인 및 핏: Regular fit ensures optimal ventilation with comfort and mobility · Removable knee pads provide thermal and impact protection", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "밑단 구성: Stretch woven powder cuff with gripper elastic and static cord adjustment helps seal out snow", "포켓 구성: Maximized storage includes two large bib pockets with key clips, hand pockets, high-capacity thigh pockets with volume pleats, and a security sleeve and key clip inside the right thigh pocket", "지원군: TPU overlay at insteps guards against edge cuts and abrasion on lower legs", "스노우스포츠 기능: RECCO® 반사경은 긴급 상황에서 수색 및 구조를 지원합니다.", "지속 가능성: Shell - bluepass Material, dope dyed backer, recycled content · Contrast - bluepass Material, recycled content · Lining - bluepass Material, recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "허리 및 벨트 구성: Drop seat functions with suspenders attached · Waist loops accommodate a rigger’s belt", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: Side zippers for easy venting · Zippered fly closure", "소재: Lining: Recycled nylon/spandex stretch plain weave FC0 DWR, 138 gsm - 86% Nylon, 14% Elastane · Contrast: RecNylon DBL Weave Solid, 220gsm, FC0 DWR - 56% Nylon, 34% Polyester, 10% Elastane · Body: 75x150d 3L GORE-TEX® PRO ePE, 151 gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane 100% Nylon Backing · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash medium · Tumble dry normal medium · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Do not leave wet · Remove immediately", "핏: Regular"],
