    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Nitra Trench Coat", "bodyKo": "The Nitra Trench Coat is a relaxed, tailored silhouette with mid-calf length, articulated sleeves, and a half-breast crossover that references classic design. GORE-TEX waterproofing combines with a front zippered closure and back storm flap for weather protection.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010311/lt-gnosis/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Relaxed", "bodyKo": "This fit is cut loosely through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Relaxed without sacrificing structure and clean lines, it offers comfort and freedom of movement with a more casual look.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010311/lt-gnosis/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable · Wind resistant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010311/lt-gnosis/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "칼라 구성", "bodyKo": "컨버터블 칼라", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010311/lt-gnosis/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "GORE-TEX® ePE delivers waterproof, windproof, breathable weather protection without intentionally added PFAS", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010311/lt-gnosis/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Back storm flap for wind and rain protection · Garment Inseam: Size S is 45\"/115cm — Inseam varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010311/lt-gnosis/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Internal zippered pocket · Two side pockets", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010311/lt-gnosis/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Dope dyed backer · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010311/lt-gnosis/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지퍼 및 플라이 구성", "bodyKo": "전면 전체 지퍼", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010311/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Body: 40dx70d 3L GORE-TEX® ePE with C-KNIT™ backer, plain weave recycled nylon, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010311/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "관리 방법", "bodyKo": "Machine wash medium · Tumble dry normal medium · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Do not leave wet · Remove immediately", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010311/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏", "bodyKo": "Relaxed", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010311/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Relaxed: This fit is cut loosely through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Relaxed without sacrificing structure and clean lines, it offers comfort and freedom of movement with a more casual look.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable · Wind resistant", "칼라 구성: 컨버터블 칼라", "구조: GORE-TEX® ePE delivers waterproof, windproof, breathable weather protection without intentionally added PFAS", "디자인 및 핏: Back storm flap for wind and rain protection · Garment Inseam: Size S is 45\"/115cm — Inseam varies by size", "포켓 구성: Internal zippered pocket · Two side pockets", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Dope dyed backer · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: 전면 전체 지퍼", "소재: Body: 40dx70d 3L GORE-TEX® ePE with C-KNIT™ backer, plain weave recycled nylon, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash medium · Tumble dry normal medium · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Do not leave wet · Remove immediately", "핏: Relaxed"],
