    editTier: "bestseller",
    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Proton Hoody", "bodyKo": "통기성이 뛰어나고 따뜻한 Proton Hoody는 추운 환경에서 등산과 역동적인 산악 활동을 위한 선택입니다. 100% 재활용된 Coreloft™ Compact insulation는 가볍고 휴대가 가능하며 젖어도 성능이 유지됩니다. 외부는 내구성이 뛰어나고 통기성이 뛰어난 Fortius Air 20 소프트쉘입니다. 통기성 소재가 함께 작용하여 증기 전달 속도를 높이고 온도를 조절하는 공기 흐름을 허용합니다. 단열 StormHood는 적용 범위를 확장하고 연결식 디자인은 움직이도록 패턴화되었습니다. 업데이트된 내용: PFAS가 없는 내구성 발수 처리 및 Coreloft™ Compact 합성 insulation로 가볍고 통기성이 뛰어난 따뜻함을 선사합니다. 더 가벼운 옵션이 필요하십니까? Proton SL Hoody를 사용해 보세요.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009095/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏: 슬림 핏", "bodyKo": "Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009095/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Moisture-resistant outer face fabric · Breathable · Lightweight · Wind resistant · Air permeable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009095/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Fortius™ Air 20 face fabric effectively balances air permeability and weather resistance with lightweight durability and stretch · Coreloft™ Compact insulation regulates temperature, performs if wet, and is made from 100% recycled materials · Breathable 20d plain weave Toray liner allows airflow and is made with recycled content", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009095/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "니트 커프스가 편안함과 스타일을 더해줍니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009095/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Fitted, with articulated patterning for mobility and comfort · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 27\"/68cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009095/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009095/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "듀얼 하단 밑단 조절 장치", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009095/black/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "60gsm PrimaLoft® 단열 헬멧 호환 후드로 추가적인 따뜻함 제공", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009095/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Two hand pockets with zippers · Chest pocket", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009095/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Body - bluepass Material · Insulation - bluepass Material, recycled content · Lining - bluepass Material, recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009095/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지퍼 및 플라이 구성", "bodyKo": "No Slip Zip™으로 실수로 열리는 것을 방지합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009095/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["핏: 슬림 핏: Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "기술적 특징: Moisture-resistant outer face fabric · Breathable · Lightweight · Wind resistant · Air permeable", "구조: Fortius™ Air 20 face fabric effectively balances air permeability and weather resistance with lightweight durability and stretch · Coreloft™ Compact insulation regulates temperature, performs if wet, and is made from 100% recycled materials · Breathable 20d plain weave Toray liner allows airflow and is made with recycled content", "밑단 및 소매 구성: 니트 커프스가 편안함과 스타일을 더해줍니다.", "디자인 및 핏: Fitted, with articulated patterning for mobility and comfort · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 27\"/68cm - Varies by size", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "밑단 구성: 듀얼 하단 밑단 조절 장치", "후드 구성: 60gsm PrimaLoft® 단열 헬멧 호환 후드로 추가적인 따뜻함 제공", "포켓 구성: Two hand pockets with zippers · Chest pocket", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Body - bluepass Material · Insulation - bluepass Material, recycled content · Lining - bluepass Material, recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: No Slip Zip™으로 실수로 열리는 것을 방지합니다.", "소재: Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™ Compact, 80gsm - 100% Polyester · Lining: 20d recycled nylon plain weave, 42gsm - 100% Nylon · Body: Fortius™ Air 20 - Plain Weave, FC0 DWR, 58gsm - 88% Nylon, 12% Elastane · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash low · Tumble dry gentle low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse", "핏: 슬림 핏"],
