    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable · Water resistant", "구조: 재활용 GORE C-KNIT™ 지지대는 조용하고 피부에 닿는 느낌이 부드러우며 통기성이 뛰어납니다.", "밑단 및 소매 구성: 커프 개스킷으로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "디자인 및 핏: 의류 센터백 길이: S 사이즈는 25\"/64cm - 사이즈에 따라 다릅니다.", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "밑단 구성: Laminated elastic hem", "후드 구성: Adjustable low profile hood · Hood’s stealth webbing, internal cord routing, and discrete cord exit at back neck maintain the minimalist profile", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "포켓 구성: Internal laminated pocket with zip · Two die-cut hidden hand pockets with zippers", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Dope dyed backer · Dope dyed uses significantly less water and energy in the dyeing process · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "소재: Body: 3L ePE GORE-TEX®, 15d recycled nylon, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane 100% Nylon Backing · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash medium · Tumble dry normal medium · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Do not leave wet · Remove immediately", "핏: Regular"],
