    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Asset Airshell Jacket", "bodyKo": "Temperatures are never a constant. With a refined, minimalist design and blousy relaxed fit, the Asset Airshell Jacket offers highly breathable protection for warmer climates’ cool, breezy days. Exceptionally light, easy to pack in a satchel or day bag, it’s made with Airshell, a stretch nylon that balances airflow with wind protection. Ergonomic patterning removes restriction, a hood extends protection, and taped seams create a clean, streamlined finish.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009639/celestia/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Relaxed", "bodyKo": "This fit is cut loosely through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Relaxed without sacrificing structure and clean lines, it offers comfort and freedom of movement with a more casual look.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009639/celestia/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Breathable · Lightweight · Air permeable · Water repellent · Packable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009639/celestia/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Finish-taped seams for a clean aesthetic · Airshell double weave nylon is highly air permeable, stretches, and is exceptionally lightweight", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009639/celestia/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "Stretch inserts at cuffs for a closer fit", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009639/celestia/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Relaxed fit for comfort and easy layering · Gathered hood, sleeve opening, and hem secure the fit and create blousy, feminine lines", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009639/celestia/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0-DWR(내구성 발수) 마감이 습기를 효과적으로 막아줍니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009639/celestia/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "로우 프로파일 후드", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009639/celestia/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009639/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "PFAS(퍼- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009639/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지퍼 및 플라이 구성", "bodyKo": "Front satin zipper with DWR for weather protection", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009639/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Body: 15d nylon double weave ripstop, 42gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009639/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Relaxed: This fit is cut loosely through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Relaxed without sacrificing structure and clean lines, it offers comfort and freedom of movement with a more casual look.", "기술적 특징: Breathable · Lightweight · Air permeable · Water repellent · Packable", "구조: Finish-taped seams for a clean aesthetic · Airshell double weave nylon is highly air permeable, stretches, and is exceptionally lightweight", "밑단 및 소매 구성: Stretch inserts at cuffs for a closer fit", "디자인 및 핏: Relaxed fit for comfort and easy layering · Gathered hood, sleeve opening, and hem secure the fit and create blousy, feminine lines", "원단 처리: FC0-DWR(내구성 발수) 마감이 습기를 효과적으로 막아줍니다.", "후드 구성: 로우 프로파일 후드", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "지속 가능성: PFAS(퍼- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: Front satin zipper with DWR for weather protection", "소재: Body: 15d nylon double weave ripstop, 42gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash low · Tumble dry normal low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse · Remove immediately · Wash inside washing bag", "핏: Relaxed"],
