    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Norvan Windshell Hoody", "bodyKo": "Flying across technical terrain – the ultimate trail-running experience doesn’t exist if your kit weighs you down. Our lightest, most air-permeable mountain running hoody protects you on exposed trails and prepares you for shifting conditions. Its Canim ripstop fabric resists wind and moisture, Permair 20 panels ventilate, a streamlined adjustable hood extends protection, and – packed into its pocket – it travels virtually unnoticed. Until you need it.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010267/mallow/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏: 슬림 핏", "bodyKo": "Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010267/mallow/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Breathable · Lightweight · Wind resistant · Water repellent · Packable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010267/mallow/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Permeair 20™ in underarm and side panels adds breathability and thermal regulation · Hybrid Mapping technology puts specific fabrics where they are most effective", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010267/mallow/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "Shaped cuffs with low profile elasticated cuff at wrist · Small integrated window in each sleeve allows you to see your watch", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010267/mallow/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "의류 센터백 길이: S 사이즈는 24\"/62cm - 사이즈에 따라 다릅니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010267/mallow/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "DWR(내구성 발수) 마감으로 습기를 차단합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010267/mallow/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "Minimal and discreet bottom hem for secure fit", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010267/mallow/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "Elastacized brim ensures visibility when in use · Adjustable low profile hood", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010267/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "로고 및 라벨 구성", "bodyKo": "반사 로고는 저조도 상황에서도 가시성을 높여줍니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010267/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010267/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Stows away in its own pocket · One zippered security pocket · Stow pocket has an elastic hand strap for easy carry on the run", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010267/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["핏: 슬림 핏: Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "기술적 특징: Breathable · Lightweight · Wind resistant · Water repellent · Packable", "구조: Permeair 20™ in underarm and side panels adds breathability and thermal regulation · Hybrid Mapping technology puts specific fabrics where they are most effective", "밑단 및 소매 구성: Shaped cuffs with low profile elasticated cuff at wrist · Small integrated window in each sleeve allows you to see your watch", "디자인 및 핏: 의류 센터백 길이: S 사이즈는 24\"/62cm - 사이즈에 따라 다릅니다.", "원단 처리: DWR(내구성 발수) 마감으로 습기를 차단합니다.", "밑단 구성: Minimal and discreet bottom hem for secure fit", "후드 구성: Elastacized brim ensures visibility when in use · Adjustable low profile hood", "로고 및 라벨 구성: 반사 로고는 저조도 상황에서도 가시성을 높여줍니다.", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "포켓 구성: Stows away in its own pocket · One zippered security pocket · Stow pocket has an elastic hand strap for easy carry on the run", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: Centered zipper at the front", "소재: Contrast: Permeair 20™ - Recycled Nylon Ripstop, FC0 DWR, 40gsm - 100% Nylon · Body: Canim™ Ripstop - HT Poly Double Weave, FC0 DWR, 39 gsm - 100% Polyester · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: 저온 기계 세탁 · 저온 일반 텀블 건조 · 표백 금지 · 어두운 색상은 분리 세탁 · 드라이클리닝 금지 · 저온 다림질 · 섬유유연제 사용 금지 · 2회 헹굼", "핏: 슬림 핏"],
    techSpecs: [],
