    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "기술적 특징: Moisture-wicking · Breathable · Durable", "구조: Underarm vents for airflow and temperature regulation", "밑단 및 소매 구성: Shaped cuffs", "디자인 및 핏: Regular fit provides freedom of movement · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 25\"/63cm - Varies by size", "밑단 구성: Dual S-lock hem cinches for even gathering and adjustable length", "포켓 구성: Stows away in its own pocket · Two hand pockets", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "UPF 등급: UPF 50+, EN 13758-2, AS4399:2020, GB/T 18830-2009. 덮힌 부분만 보호됩니다. 사용하거나 늘어나거나 젖으면 보호 기능이 저하될 수 있습니다.", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: Front zipper with semi-auto locking slider", "소재: Body: 30d Recycled Nylon stretch ripstop, 62gsm, FC0 DWR - 87% Nylon, 13% Elastane · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash gentle low · Tumble dry normal low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse · Remove immediately · Wash inside washing bag", "핏: Regular"],
