    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Altira Cropped Jacket", "bodyKo": "Our design team is pushing the boundaries of what GORE-TEX ePE can do in this innovative, waterproof hardshell that'll keep you dry on the trail when mountain storms roll in. Relaxed shoulders, a cropped length, and back pleats team up with utility pockets, a hem cinch to lock out drafts, and an adjustable StormHood™ for that just-right balance of distinctive fit and technical details.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010094/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Relaxed", "bodyKo": "This fit is cut loosely through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Relaxed without sacrificing structure and clean lines, it offers comfort and freedom of movement with a more casual look.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010094/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010094/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Made from stretch fibres and wicking yarns for technical performance · Hardwearing 200D recycled nylon canvas face for added durability · GORE C-KNIT™ backer technology is quiet, soft next-to-skin, highly breathable, and made with recycled content", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010094/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Cropped length design · Relaxed fit for comfort and easy layering · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 22\"/56cm - Varies by size · Pleated back and sleeves for improved freedom of movement and comfort", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010094/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "DWR(내구성 발수) 마감으로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010094/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010094/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "조정 가능한 로우 프로파일 StormHood™", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010094/black/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Two bonded hand pockets with bellow", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010094/forage/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Dope dyed backer · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010094/forage/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지퍼 및 플라이 구성", "bodyKo": "Custom zipper pulls are glove-friendly", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010094/forage/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Body: 3L GORE-TEX® ePE Jet Dyed 200d recycled nylon, 213gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010094/forage/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Relaxed: This fit is cut loosely through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Relaxed without sacrificing structure and clean lines, it offers comfort and freedom of movement with a more casual look.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable", "구조: Made from stretch fibres and wicking yarns for technical performance · Hardwearing 200D recycled nylon canvas face for added durability · GORE C-KNIT™ backer technology is quiet, soft next-to-skin, highly breathable, and made with recycled content", "디자인 및 핏: Cropped length design · Relaxed fit for comfort and easy layering · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 22\"/56cm - Varies by size · Pleated back and sleeves for improved freedom of movement and comfort", "원단 처리: DWR(내구성 발수) 마감으로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "밑단 구성: 조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "후드 구성: 조정 가능한 로우 프로파일 StormHood™", "포켓 구성: Two bonded hand pockets with bellow", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Dope dyed backer · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: Custom zipper pulls are glove-friendly", "소재: Body: 3L GORE-TEX® ePE Jet Dyed 200d recycled nylon, 213gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash medium · Tumble dry normal medium · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Do not leave wet · Remove immediately", "핏: Relaxed"],
