    registeredAt: "2026-07-31T17:43:17.000Z",
    editTier: "new",
    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Rhoam Hybrid Jacket", "bodyKo": "The Rhoam is a rugged hybrid mountain biking shell that shakes off light weather and mud as easily as it does steep climbs. Intentional, mountain bike-specific body mapping puts fabrics where they are most effective: stretch softshell in key areas for breathability and waterproof hardshell fabric everywhere else to fend off the elements. Fully helmet-compatible to maximize peripheral vision, the StormHood keeps you covered through every jump, bump, and berm on or off the trail.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009562/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏: 슬림 핏", "bodyKo": "Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009562/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Breathable · Lightweight · Durable · Water resistant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009562/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Recycled GORE C-KNIT™ backer is quiet, soft next-to-skin, and highly breathable · Mountain bike-specific hybrid mapping puts the best available fabrics where they are most effective to maximize performance · Recycled stretch-nylon softshell under the arms provides ventilation and performance stretch · Three-layer waterproof hardshell panels in high-exposure areas · This product is not fully waterproof and is therefore labelled as WINDSTOPPER® by GORE-TEX Labs", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009562/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "Velcro® 잠금 장치가 있는 조절 가능한 커프", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009562/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Mountain bike-specific articulation for mobility, comfort, and layering options · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 30\"/75cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009562/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009562/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009562/black/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "Single pull adjuster does not restrict vision · Adjustable StormHood™", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009562/forage/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Chest pocket with zip · Lower-back pocketing system with internal organization for easy-access, bounce-free storage", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009562/forage/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Shell - dope dyed backer, recycled content · Contrast - bluepass Material, recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009562/forage/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지퍼 및 플라이 구성", "bodyKo": "양방향 전면 지퍼", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009562/forage/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["핏: 슬림 핏: Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "기술적 특징: Breathable · Lightweight · Durable · Water resistant", "구조: Recycled GORE C-KNIT™ backer is quiet, soft next-to-skin, and highly breathable · Mountain bike-specific hybrid mapping puts the best available fabrics where they are most effective to maximize performance · Recycled stretch-nylon softshell under the arms provides ventilation and performance stretch · Three-layer waterproof hardshell panels in high-exposure areas · This product is not fully waterproof and is therefore labelled as WINDSTOPPER® by GORE-TEX Labs", "밑단 및 소매 구성: Velcro® 잠금 장치가 있는 조절 가능한 커프", "디자인 및 핏: Mountain bike-specific articulation for mobility, comfort, and layering options · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 30\"/75cm - Varies by size", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "밑단 구성: 조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "후드 구성: Single pull adjuster does not restrict vision · Adjustable StormHood™", "포켓 구성: Chest pocket with zip · Lower-back pocketing system with internal organization for easy-access, bounce-free storage", "지속 가능성: Shell - dope dyed backer, recycled content · Contrast - bluepass Material, recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: 양방향 전면 지퍼", "소재: Contrast: 50D Recycled Nylon Stretch Woven Plain Weave, 97gsm, FC0 DWR - 84% Nylon, 16% Elastane · Body: 3L ePE hardshell; 20d recycled nylon mini rip, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon Backing 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash medium · Tumble dry normal medium · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Do not leave wet · Remove immediately", "핏: 슬림 핏"],
