    editTier: "bestseller",
    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Cerium SL Hoody", "bodyKo": "The Cerium SL Hoody is a highly packable, exceptionally warm down layer for low-output activities ranging from breakfast at base camp to rest stops on your way to a North Cascades alpine summit. Under its ultralight, abrasion-resistant nylon shell, we’ve placed 1000-fill European grey goose down in the body, arms, and hood for maximum warmth and Coreloft™ synthetic insulation under the arms to help you stay dry when you’re out of your comfort zone but not ready to shed layers yet. Need a heavier option? Try the Cerium Hoody .", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011029/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏: 슬림 핏", "bodyKo": "Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011029/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Moisture-resistant outer face fabric · Breathable · Great warmth-to-weight ratio · Lightweight · Compressible and packable · Durable · Ultralight", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011029/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Down Composite Mapping™ strategically places synthetic insulation in areas where moisture may buildup and down in areas for maximum warmth · Ultra-lofty premium 1000 fill grey goose down delivers exceptional warmth for its weight · 10D Pertex® Quantum mini-ripstop nylon shell is ultralight, durable, inherently downproof, and made with recycled content · Sewn-through construction saves weight and minimizes down shift", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011029/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "스트레치 니트 소맷단", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011029/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Fitted, with articulated patterning for mobility and comfort · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 25\"/64cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011029/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011029/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011029/black/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "조절 가능하고 단열된 StormHood™", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011029/mallow/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "통합된 기능", "bodyKo": "컴팩트하게 운반할 수 있는 물건 자루 포함", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011029/mallow/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Internal chest pocket · Two insulated hand pockets with zippers", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011029/mallow/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Shell - bluepass Material, recycled content · Padding - bluepass Material, recycled content · Lining - bluepass Material, recycled content · RDS (Responsible Down Standard) - 100% of our down is certified to the RDS by IDFL (No.TE-99950273) · Feather - This product contains feather not exceeding that allowable by law · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant · Sterilization Permit Number- PER. NO. PA-8811 (CA)", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011029/mallow/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["핏: 슬림 핏: Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "기술적 특징: Moisture-resistant outer face fabric · Breathable · Great warmth-to-weight ratio · Lightweight · Compressible and packable · Durable · Ultralight", "구조: Down Composite Mapping™ strategically places synthetic insulation in areas where moisture may buildup and down in areas for maximum warmth · Ultra-lofty premium 1000 fill grey goose down delivers exceptional warmth for its weight · 10D Pertex® Quantum mini-ripstop nylon shell is ultralight, durable, inherently downproof, and made with recycled content · Sewn-through construction saves weight and minimizes down shift", "밑단 및 소매 구성: 스트레치 니트 소맷단", "디자인 및 핏: Fitted, with articulated patterning for mobility and comfort · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 25\"/64cm - Varies by size", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "밑단 구성: 조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "후드 구성: 조절 가능하고 단열된 StormHood™", "통합된 기능: 컴팩트하게 운반할 수 있는 물건 자루 포함", "포켓 구성: Internal chest pocket · Two insulated hand pockets with zippers", "지속 가능성: Shell - bluepass Material, recycled content · Padding - bluepass Material, recycled content · Lining - bluepass Material, recycled content · RDS (Responsible Down Standard) - 100% of our down is certified to the RDS by IDFL (No.TE-99950273) · Feather - This product contains feather not exceeding that allowable by law · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant · Sterilization Permit Number- PER. NO. PA-8811 (CA)", "소재: Down Insulation: 1000 fill grey goose down, min 90/10, RDS - 100% Grey Goose Down (minimum 90% down) · Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™, 40gsm - 100% Polyester · Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™ 60gsm - 100% Polyester · Lining: Quantum downproof, 28gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon · Body: 10D Pertex® Quantum, 28gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash gentle low · Tumble dry gentle low · Tumble dry low with tennis balls · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse · Front load washer recommended · Use mesh bag for top load washer", "핏: 슬림 핏"],
