    tags: ["arcteryx", "아크테릭스", "clothing", "ax-womens", "womens"],
    descriptionKo: "Warm down-insulated GORE-TEX parka for outdoor activities in cold environments.",
    image: "/products/axa-pdp/X000009858/black/1.jpg",
    images: ["/products/axa-pdp/X000009858/black/1.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009858/black/2.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009858/black/3.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009858/black/4.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009858/black/5.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009858/black/6.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009858/black/7.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009858/black/8.jpg"],
