    sourceUrl: "https://arcteryx.com/gb/en/shop/womens/liatris-down-parka-9858",
    registeredAt: "2026-07-31T17:43:20.000Z",
    editTier: "bestseller",
    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Liatris Down Parka", "bodyKo": "Weather protection and exceptional warmth – the Liatris is a parka for the coldest environments. GORE-TEX shuts out wind, rain, and snow and has C-KNIT™ backer technology for added softness and breathability. Light, lofty 850 fill goose down insulates and is held in place with a unique stitch-free bonded baffle technology for added durability. The length combines with an insulated hood and collar for added warmth, multiple pockets provide storage, and the articulated fit moves with you.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009858/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Relaxed", "bodyKo": "This fit is cut loosely through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Relaxed without sacrificing structure and clean lines, it offers comfort and freedom of movement with a more casual look.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009858/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009858/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "칼라 구성", "bodyKo": "Insulated 칼라", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009858/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "GORE-TEX® three-layer construction delivers complete weather protection · GORE C-KNIT™ backer technology is light, soft and comfortable · Stitch-free bonded baffle construction adds durability, improves GORE-TEX® integrity · Down Composite Mapping™ combines down with strategic use of Coreloft™ synthetic insulation in moisture-prone areas · Lofty 850 fill European grey goose down delivers exceptional warmth for its weight and is RDS (Responsible Down Standard) certified", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009858/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "Internal sleeve gasket seals out drafts", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009858/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Relaxed fit for comfort and easy layering · Longer length for additional coverage · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 43\"/110cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009858/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "Insulated StormHood™ · Helmet compatible · Low profile hood", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009858/black/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009858/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Two chest pockets with zippers · Note: Our WaterTight™ zippers are highly water resistant, but not waterproof. We do not recommend keeping items in your pockets that may be damaged by moisture · Dual-entry, insulated hand pockets with brushed lining provide warmth and storage · Two internal dump pockets, one with secure internal pocket, hold gloves or toque", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009858/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Shell - bluepass Material, dope dyed backer, recycled content · Lining - recycled content · RDS (Responsible Down Standard) - 100% of our down is certified to the RDS by IDFL (No.TE-99950273) · Feather - This product contains feather not exceeding that allowable by law · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009858/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지퍼 및 플라이 구성", "bodyKo": "Full front zip · Side zippers for easy venting", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009858/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Relaxed: This fit is cut loosely through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Relaxed without sacrificing structure and clean lines, it offers comfort and freedom of movement with a more casual look.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable", "칼라 구성: Insulated 칼라", "구조: GORE-TEX® three-layer construction delivers complete weather protection · GORE C-KNIT™ backer technology is light, soft and comfortable · Stitch-free bonded baffle construction adds durability, improves GORE-TEX® integrity · Down Composite Mapping™ combines down with strategic use of Coreloft™ synthetic insulation in moisture-prone areas · Lofty 850 fill European grey goose down delivers exceptional warmth for its weight and is RDS (Responsible Down Standard) certified", "밑단 및 소매 구성: Internal sleeve gasket seals out drafts", "디자인 및 핏: Relaxed fit for comfort and easy layering · Longer length for additional coverage · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 43\"/110cm - Varies by size", "후드 구성: Insulated StormHood™ · Helmet compatible · Low profile hood", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "포켓 구성: Two chest pockets with zippers · Note: Our WaterTight™ zippers are highly water resistant, but not waterproof. We do not recommend keeping items in your pockets that may be damaged by moisture · Dual-entry, insulated hand pockets with brushed lining provide warmth and storage · Two internal dump pockets, one with secure internal pocket, hold gloves or toque", "지속 가능성: Shell - bluepass Material, dope dyed backer, recycled content · Lining - recycled content · RDS (Responsible Down Standard) - 100% of our down is certified to the RDS by IDFL (No.TE-99950273) · Feather - This product contains feather not exceeding that allowable by law · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: Full front zip · Side zippers for easy venting", "소재: Down Insulation: 850 fill European grey goose down, min 90/10, RDS - 100% Grey Goose Down (minimum 90% down) · Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™ Continuous 90 (90 g/m²) - 100% Polyester · Body: 80d 3L GORE-TEX® ePE with C-KNIT™ backer, plain weave recycled nylon, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane · Lining: Quantum downproof, 28gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash low · Tumble dry low with tennis balls · Tumble dry permanent press low · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Front load washer recommended · Use mesh bag for top load washer", "핏: Relaxed"],
