    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Decca Down Parka", "bodyKo": "추운 날씨를 위한 Decca 다운 파카는 다운 insulation와 GORE-TEX 방수 기능을 갖춘 따뜻하고 편안한 재킷입니다. 클래식 파카 모양의 후드 실루엣에는 비와 바람을 막아주는 GORE-TEX 패브릭과 결합된 합성 매핑된 유럽 회색 구스 다운 insulation를 포함한 광범위한 기능 세트가 함께 제공됩니다. 꼭 맞는 커프가 외풍을 막아주고, 다양한 포켓이 겨울철에도 편안함과 실용성을 유지합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009961/dark-cocoon/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Relaxed", "bodyKo": "This fit is cut loosely through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Relaxed without sacrificing structure and clean lines, it offers comfort and freedom of movement with a more casual look.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009961/dark-cocoon/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Breathable · Wind resistant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009961/dark-cocoon/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "850 fill European white goose down for exceptional warmth-to-weight ratio · PFAS-free GORE-TEX® ePE with a recycled face delivers complete waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · Recycled GORE C-KNIT™ backer is quiet, soft next-to-skin, and highly breathable · Body and hood are framed with 25gsm synthetic insulation to add warmth", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009961/dark-cocoon/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "커프 개스킷으로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009961/dark-cocoon/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "의류 센터 백 길이: S 사이즈는 39\"/98cm - 사이즈에 따라 다릅니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009961/dark-cocoon/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "DWR(내구성 발수) 마감으로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009961/dark-cocoon/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "Insulated, adjustable hood · Insulated hood gasket", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009961/dark-cocoon/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Hidden front hand pockets · Two internal pockets · Two side pockets", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009961/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Shell - bluepass Material, dope dyed backer, recycled content · Lining - bluepass Material, recycled content · RDS (Responsible Down Standard) - 100% of our down is certified to the RDS by IDFL (No.TE-99950273) · Feather - This product contains feather not exceeding that allowable by law · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant · Padding - recycled content", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009961/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지퍼 및 플라이 구성", "bodyKo": "양방향 전면 지퍼", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009961/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Down Insulation: 850 fill European grey goose down, min 90/10, RDS - 100% Grey Goose Down (minimum 90% down) · Lining: 20d recycled nylon downproof, 42gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon · Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™ Stretch, 25gsm - 100% Polyester · Body: 3L ePE GORE-TEX®, 15d recycled nylon, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane 100% Nylon Backing · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009961/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Relaxed: This fit is cut loosely through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Relaxed without sacrificing structure and clean lines, it offers comfort and freedom of movement with a more casual look.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Breathable · Wind resistant", "구조: 850 fill European white goose down for exceptional warmth-to-weight ratio · PFAS-free GORE-TEX® ePE with a recycled face delivers complete waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · Recycled GORE C-KNIT™ backer is quiet, soft next-to-skin, and highly breathable · Body and hood are framed with 25gsm synthetic insulation to add warmth", "밑단 및 소매 구성: 커프 개스킷으로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "디자인 및 핏: 의류 센터 백 길이: S 사이즈는 39\"/98cm - 사이즈에 따라 다릅니다.", "원단 처리: DWR(내구성 발수) 마감으로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "후드 구성: Insulated, adjustable hood · Insulated hood gasket", "포켓 구성: Hidden front hand pockets · Two internal pockets · Two side pockets", "지속 가능성: Shell - bluepass Material, dope dyed backer, recycled content · Lining - bluepass Material, recycled content · RDS (Responsible Down Standard) - 100% of our down is certified to the RDS by IDFL (No.TE-99950273) · Feather - This product contains feather not exceeding that allowable by law · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant · Padding - recycled content", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: 양방향 전면 지퍼", "소재: Down Insulation: 850 fill European grey goose down, min 90/10, RDS - 100% Grey Goose Down (minimum 90% down) · Lining: 20d recycled nylon downproof, 42gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon · Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™ Stretch, 25gsm - 100% Polyester · Body: 3L ePE GORE-TEX®, 15d recycled nylon, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane 100% Nylon Backing · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash low · Tumble dry low with tennis balls · Tumble dry permanent press low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Front load washer recommended · Use mesh bag for top load washer", "핏: Relaxed"],
