    registeredAt: "2026-07-31T17:43:24.000Z",
    editTier: "bestseller",
    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Alpha SL Pant", "bodyKo": "From crossing snowfields to front-pointing up alpine ice in crampons, the Alpha SL Pant delivers full-strength protection in minimalist form. Constructed with GORE-TEX PRO ePE with ultralight 20D Hadron™ face fabric, these pants provide superior waterproof breathability. When weather hits, side-separating zippers let you put these pants on fast without having to remove your alpine boots. All this in a package so light you'll never think twice about carrying a pair in your pack.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010323/euphoria/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably under our regular and relaxed fit shells.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010323/euphoria/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010323/euphoria/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "GORE-TEX® PRO ePE fabric free from intentionally added PFAS provides lightweight, durable, waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · Our proprietary Hadron™ face fabric delivers ultralight performance and alpine-tested durability", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010323/euphoria/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "Durable lower leg wrap shields against wear, tear, and crampon snags", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010323/euphoria/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Garment Inseam: Size 4 is 32\"/81.5cm — Inseam varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010323/euphoria/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010323/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "Reinforced hems with adjusters deliver a clean, secure fit", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010323/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "로고 및 라벨 구성", "bodyKo": "Arc'teryx word logo · Arc'teryx Bird logo", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010323/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "스노우스포츠 기능", "bodyKo": "RECCO® reflector aids search and rescue in emergency situations · Lace hooks affixes pant to boot", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010323/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Dope dyed backer · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant · Dope dyed face", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010323/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "허리 및 벨트 구성", "bodyKo": "Streamlined waist adjuster ensures a secure fit, while an elasticized back waist stays comfortable under a harness", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010323/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably under our regular and relaxed fit shells.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable", "구조: GORE-TEX® PRO ePE fabric free from intentionally added PFAS provides lightweight, durable, waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · Our proprietary Hadron™ face fabric delivers ultralight performance and alpine-tested durability", "밑단 및 소매 구성: Durable lower leg wrap shields against wear, tear, and crampon snags", "디자인 및 핏: Garment Inseam: Size 4 is 32\"/81.5cm — Inseam varies by size", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "밑단 구성: Reinforced hems with adjusters deliver a clean, secure fit", "로고 및 라벨 구성: Arc'teryx word logo · Arc'teryx Bird logo", "스노우스포츠 기능: RECCO® reflector aids search and rescue in emergency situations · Lace hooks affixes pant to boot", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Dope dyed backer · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant · Dope dyed face", "허리 및 벨트 구성: Streamlined waist adjuster ensures a secure fit, while an elasticized back waist stays comfortable under a harness", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: Full length separating side zippers to allow removal over boots and crampons", "소재: Body: 20D Hadron™ - 3L GORE-TEX® PRO, 78gsm, FC0 DWR - 94% Nylon, 6% Polyarylate with ePE & PU Membrane 100% Nylon Backing · Contrast: 50D Hadron™- 3L GORE-TEX® PRO ePE, 99 gsm, FC0 DWR - 94% Nylon, 6% Polyarylate with ePE and PU Membrane 100% Nylon Backing · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash medium · Tumble dry normal medium · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Do not leave wet · Remove immediately", "핏: Regular"],
