    registeredAt: "2026-07-31T17:43:27.000Z",
    editTier: "bestseller",
    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Delta Jacket", "bodyKo": "우리의 가장 기술적인 플리스 미드레이어 재킷은 편안함을 뛰어넘는 성능을 제공합니다. 통기성이 뛰어나고 내구성이 뛰어나며 부드러운 플리스의 혁신적인 중공 코어 섬유 구조는 무게에 비해 뛰어난 보온성을 제공합니다. 매끄러운 얼굴은 내구성을 더해주며, 팔 아래의 Phasic AR II 패널은 신축성을 더해주고 흡수성 섬유로 만들어졌습니다. 인체공학적으로 자유로운 패턴과 쉘 아래에 쉽게 겹쳐서 입을 수 있는 핏을 갖춘 Delta는 캠프에서나 이동 중에도 독립형 보온 레이어로 빛을 발합니다. 크기 및 핏 팁: Delta는 이전 모델보다 몸과 소매에 더 넓은 핏을 제공하여 고출력 활동 중에 향상된 편안함, 다용성 및 자유로운 움직임을 제공합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010560/forage-habitat/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏: 슬림 핏", "bodyKo": "Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010560/forage-habitat/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Breathable · Durable · Warm and comfortable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010560/forage-habitat/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "칼라 구성", "bodyKo": "편안함을 더해주는 턱 가드", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010560/forage-habitat/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Flatlock seam construction improves next-to-skin comfort · Phasic™ AR II engineered polyester fabric is soft, offers stretch and thermal comfort, and is made with wicking fibres · Innovative fleece insulation has a unique hollow-core fibre construction delivering an exceptional warmth-to-weight ratio, soft comfort, has a smooth face for improved durability · Fleece’s construction creates a smooth face for improved durability and layers more comfortably", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010560/forage-habitat/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "의류 센터백 길이: S 사이즈는 24\"/62cm - 사이즈에 따라 다릅니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010560/forage-habitat/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010560/forage-habitat/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Two hand pockets with zippers · Laminated chest pocket with laminated zip", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010560/forage-habitat/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Body - recycled content · Lining - bluepass Material · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010560/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지퍼 및 플라이 구성", "bodyKo": "전면 전체 지퍼", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010560/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Contrast: Warp knit mesh - 100% Polyester · Body: Octa Polyester Fleece, 40D Delta Face, 122gsm - 100% Polyester · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010560/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "관리 방법", "bodyKo": "Machine wash gentle low · Tumble dry gentle low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener · Remove immediately · Wash inside out · Do not wring", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010560/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["핏: 슬림 핏: Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "기술적 특징: Breathable · Durable · Warm and comfortable", "칼라 구성: 편안함을 더해주는 턱 가드", "구조: Flatlock seam construction improves next-to-skin comfort · Phasic™ AR II engineered polyester fabric is soft, offers stretch and thermal comfort, and is made with wicking fibres · Innovative fleece insulation has a unique hollow-core fibre construction delivering an exceptional warmth-to-weight ratio, soft comfort, has a smooth face for improved durability · Fleece’s construction creates a smooth face for improved durability and layers more comfortably", "디자인 및 핏: 의류 센터백 길이: S 사이즈는 24\"/62cm - 사이즈에 따라 다릅니다.", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "포켓 구성: Two hand pockets with zippers · Laminated chest pocket with laminated zip", "지속 가능성: Body - recycled content · Lining - bluepass Material · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: 전면 전체 지퍼", "소재: Contrast: Warp knit mesh - 100% Polyester · Body: Octa Polyester Fleece, 40D Delta Face, 122gsm - 100% Polyester · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash gentle low · Tumble dry gentle low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener · Remove immediately · Wash inside out · Do not wring", "핏: 슬림 핏"],
