    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Sonii SL Utility Short 10\"", "bodyKo": "A longer-length short built for summer trekking and everyday touring. Lightweight softshell fabric breathes and stretches, and the wide leg opening means unrestricted freedom to lunge, stretch, and summit. Plus, plenty of pockets so you can leave the pack behind.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011122/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Relaxed", "bodyKo": "This fit is cut loosely through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Relaxed without sacrificing structure and clean lines, it offers comfort and freedom of movement with a more casual look.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011122/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Lightweight · Wind resistant · Versatile · Water repellent", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011122/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Superlight (SL), durable softshell fabric resists snags, tears, and abrasions", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011122/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Relaxed fit for comfort and easy layering · Articulated design for unrestricted movement · Garment Inseam: Size 4 is 10\"/25.5cm — Inseam varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011122/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "편안함과 자유로운 움직임을 위한 거싯 처리된 가랑이", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011122/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Two hand pockets with zippers · One thigh pocket", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011122/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Shell - bluepass Material · Lining - bluepass Material · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011122/sea-salt/1.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "UPF 등급", "bodyKo": "40세 이상", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011122/sea-salt/2.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "허리 및 벨트 구성", "bodyKo": "Adjustable low-profile waistbelt fits comfortably under a harness or pack", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011122/sea-salt/3.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지퍼 및 플라이 구성", "bodyKo": "Low-profile hidden snap closure at waist", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011122/sea-salt/4.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Contrast: 70d Nylon/spandex plain weave with FC0 DWR, 123gsm - 94% Nylon, 6% Elastane · Body: Fortius™ DW 1.0 - Woven Double Weave, 125gsm - 86% Nylon, 14% Elastane · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000011122/sea-salt/5.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Relaxed: This fit is cut loosely through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Relaxed without sacrificing structure and clean lines, it offers comfort and freedom of movement with a more casual look.", "기술적 특징: Lightweight · Wind resistant · Versatile · Water repellent", "구조: Superlight (SL), durable softshell fabric resists snags, tears, and abrasions", "디자인 및 핏: Relaxed fit for comfort and easy layering · Articulated design for unrestricted movement · Garment Inseam: Size 4 is 10\"/25.5cm — Inseam varies by size", "패터닝: 편안함과 자유로운 움직임을 위한 거싯 처리된 가랑이", "포켓 구성: Two hand pockets with zippers · One thigh pocket", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Shell - bluepass Material · Lining - bluepass Material · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "UPF 등급: 40세 이상", "허리 및 벨트 구성: Adjustable low-profile waistbelt fits comfortably under a harness or pack", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: Low-profile hidden snap closure at waist", "소재: Contrast: 70d Nylon/spandex plain weave with FC0 DWR, 123gsm - 94% Nylon, 6% Elastane · Body: Fortius™ DW 1.0 - Woven Double Weave, 125gsm - 86% Nylon, 14% Elastane · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: 저온 기계 세탁 · 저온 일반 텀블 건조 · 표백 금지 · 어두운 색상은 분리 세탁 · 드라이클리닝 금지 · 저온 다림질 · 섬유유연제 사용 금지 · 2회 헹굼", "핏: Relaxed"],
