    inStock: false,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Sunna Tank", "bodyKo": "High mileage isn’t just your route plan, it’s what you'll get out of this technical tank. Built for strenuous hikes and hard efforts, the Sunna moves moisture away from the body to keep you cooler in hot conditions. Lightweight, stretchy fabric stays put on steep scrambles and traverses, and the relaxed, cropped fit keeps air flowing when you need it most. More styles include the Sunna Hoody , Sunna Speed Bird Crop Shirt, and Sunna Crew Shirt LS .", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010252/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Relaxed", "bodyKo": "This fit is cut loosely through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Relaxed without sacrificing structure and clean lines, it offers comfort and freedom of movement with a more casual look.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010252/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Breathable · Lightweight · Quick-drying · Antimicrobial", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010252/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Lightweight fabric with four-way stretch is super breathable and has excellent moisture management", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010252/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Cropped length design · Relaxed fit for comfort and easy layering", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010252/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "이동성과 편안함을 위한 거싯 처리된 겨드랑이 부분", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010252/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Recycled content · This article was treated with an anti-odour biocidal product (Silvadur™ ) · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010252/pineberry/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Body: 40d Recycled Polyester with Solotex Circular Knit Waffle, 110gsm - 100% Polyester · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010252/pineberry/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "관리 방법", "bodyKo": "Machine wash gentle medium · Tumble dry normal low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Iron low · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse · Remove immediately", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010252/pineberry/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏", "bodyKo": "Relaxed", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010252/pineberry/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Relaxed: This fit is cut loosely through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Relaxed without sacrificing structure and clean lines, it offers comfort and freedom of movement with a more casual look.", "기술적 특징: Breathable · Lightweight · Quick-drying · Antimicrobial", "구조: Lightweight fabric with four-way stretch is super breathable and has excellent moisture management", "디자인 및 핏: Cropped length design · Relaxed fit for comfort and easy layering", "패터닝: 이동성과 편안함을 위한 거싯 처리된 겨드랑이 부분", "지속 가능성: Recycled content · This article was treated with an anti-odour biocidal product (Silvadur™ ) · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "소재: Body: 40d Recycled Polyester with Solotex Circular Knit Waffle, 110gsm - 100% Polyester · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash gentle medium · Tumble dry normal low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Iron low · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse · Remove immediately", "핏: Relaxed"],
