    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Sunna Speed Bird Crew Shirt SS", "bodyKo": "High mileage isn’t just your route plan, it’s what you'll get out of this technical, graphic tee. Built for strenuous hikes and hard efforts, the Sunna moves moisture away from the body to keep you cooler in hot conditions. Lightweight, stretchy fabric stays put on steep scrambles and traverses, and the pack-compatible length keeps you covered however long you’re out there. More styles include the Sunna Crew Shirt LS , Sunna Hoody , and Sunna Tank .", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010248/alpine-blue/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010248/alpine-blue/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Breathable · Lightweight · Quick-drying · Antimicrobial", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010248/alpine-blue/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Lightweight fabric with four-way stretch is super breathable and has excellent moisture management", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010248/alpine-blue/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Longer length makes it ideal for wearing under a harness", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010248/alpine-blue/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "이동성과 편안함을 위한 거싯 처리된 겨드랑이 부분", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010248/alpine-blue/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Recycled content · This article was treated with an anti-odour biocidal product (Silvadur™ ) · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010248/habitat/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Body: 40d Recycled Polyester with Solotex Circular Knit Waffle, 110gsm - 100% Polyester · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010248/habitat/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "관리 방법", "bodyKo": "Machine wash gentle medium · Tumble dry normal low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Iron low · Do not use fabric softener", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010248/habitat/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏", "bodyKo": "Regular", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010248/habitat/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "기술적 특징: Breathable · Lightweight · Quick-drying · Antimicrobial", "구조: Lightweight fabric with four-way stretch is super breathable and has excellent moisture management", "디자인 및 핏: Longer length makes it ideal for wearing under a harness", "패터닝: 이동성과 편안함을 위한 거싯 처리된 겨드랑이 부분", "지속 가능성: Recycled content · This article was treated with an anti-odour biocidal product (Silvadur™ ) · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "소재: Body: 40d Recycled Polyester with Solotex Circular Knit Waffle, 110gsm - 100% Polyester · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash gentle medium · Tumble dry normal low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Iron low · Do not use fabric softener", "핏: Regular"],
