    registeredAt: "2026-07-31T17:43:41.000Z",
    editTier: "bestseller",
    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Norvan Jacket", "bodyKo": "An ultralight solution for running in the rain, the Norvan Jacket offers exceptional breathability while keeping you dry. The fully waterproof fabric allows sweat to escape without letting outside moisture in so you can focus solely on the trail in front of you. Run-friendly details like vents under the arms make staying on pace no sweat. What's been updated: Updated with lighter, more durable, and PFAS-free 15D GORE-TEX ePE. Design updates include a new stowable, zippered hip pocket; large reflective branding for low-light visibility; a fully adjustable hood with a small brim; an interior flip cuff for added warmth and protection during bad weather; a new adjustable cordlock system at the hem; and a more discreet RECCO® reflector placement (in the hood). This product is free of intentionally added PFAS. The new ePE membrane technology is lighter and thinner, but just as strong and durable as the materials we used before. You may notice the face fabric “wetting out” slightly faster in products with ePE membranes, but rest assured this does not affect the waterproofing of the membrane itself. If you notice the fabric wetting out faster than you’d like, simply wash the jacket and dry it to remove the oil contamination and bring the DWR back to its full power.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009469/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏: 슬림 핏", "bodyKo": "Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009469/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable · Packable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009469/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Ergonomic seam lines minimize irritation · PFAS-free GORE-TEX® ePE with a recycled face delivers complete waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · GORE C-KNIT™ backer technology is quiet, soft next-to-skin, highly breathable, and made with recycled content · Vents under the arms and at the back yoke provide temperature-regulating airflow, even while wearing a Norvan Vest", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009469/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "Laminated cuffs · Encased elastic at the cuff and hem seals out drafts", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009469/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Fitted, with articulated patterning for mobility and comfort · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 27\"/68cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009469/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009469/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "Adjustable hood drawcord with single pull adjuster · Low profile hood", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009469/black/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "통합된 기능", "bodyKo": "Reflective elements increase visibility in low light · Integrated flip-mitts in sleeves warm the hands and tuck away unnoticed when not in use", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009469/dk-shincha/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Stows away in its own pocket · Hip pocket with zip", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009469/dk-shincha/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "스노우스포츠 기능", "bodyKo": "RECCO® 반사경은 긴급 상황에서 수색 및 구조를 지원합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009469/dk-shincha/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Dope dyed backer · Dope dyed uses significantly less water and energy in the dyeing process · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009469/dk-shincha/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["핏: 슬림 핏: Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable · Packable", "구조: Ergonomic seam lines minimize irritation · PFAS-free GORE-TEX® ePE with a recycled face delivers complete waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · GORE C-KNIT™ backer technology is quiet, soft next-to-skin, highly breathable, and made with recycled content · Vents under the arms and at the back yoke provide temperature-regulating airflow, even while wearing a Norvan Vest", "밑단 및 소매 구성: Laminated cuffs · Encased elastic at the cuff and hem seals out drafts", "디자인 및 핏: Fitted, with articulated patterning for mobility and comfort · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 27\"/68cm - Varies by size", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "후드 구성: Adjustable hood drawcord with single pull adjuster · Low profile hood", "통합된 기능: Reflective elements increase visibility in low light · Integrated flip-mitts in sleeves warm the hands and tuck away unnoticed when not in use", "포켓 구성: Stows away in its own pocket · Hip pocket with zip", "스노우스포츠 기능: RECCO® 반사경은 긴급 상황에서 수색 및 구조를 지원합니다.", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Dope dyed backer · Dope dyed uses significantly less water and energy in the dyeing process · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "소재: Body: 3L ePE GORE-TEX®, 15d recycled nylon, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane 100% Nylon Backing · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash medium · Tumble dry normal medium · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Do not leave wet · Remove immediately", "핏: 슬림 핏"],
