    registeredAt: "2026-07-31T17:43:43.000Z",
    editTier: "bestseller",
    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Ski Guide Jacket", "bodyKo": "Designed for those who work all day, every day in the mountains, this highly durable, weatherproof 100D GORE-TEX PRO ePE ski and snowboard hardshell has been updated for improved performance. Built specifically for mechanized guiding, patrollers, and mountain professionals, this guide-approved icon now features a removable RECCO® reflector with a lower-profile design and is free from intentionally added PFAS.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009168/viper-yellow/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009168/viper-yellow/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009168/viper-yellow/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Exceptionally durable 3L GORE-TEX® PRO ePE with a recycled nylon face delivers waterproof, windproof, breathable protection and is free from intentionally added PFAS—all without adding a lot of weight", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009168/viper-yellow/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "장갑 친화적인 벨크로 커프 조절 장치로 소매를 고정합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009168/viper-yellow/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "레귤러 핏으로 최적의 통기성과 편안함과 이동성을 보장합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009168/viper-yellow/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009168/viper-yellow/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "Drawstring hem adjusters seal out drafts", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009168/viper-yellow/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "Helmet compatible StormHood™ provides full coverage without impacting visibility · High-vis orange panel on the hood is easily identifiable from the ground or air", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009168/lt-tanager/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "통합된 기능", "bodyKo": "Loops at each side of the neck secure a microphone", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009168/lt-tanager/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "이동성과 편안함을 위한 스노우스포츠 전용 연결 패턴", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009168/lt-tanager/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Left chest pocket is sized to be radio compatible · Maximized storage includes oversized chest pockets with volume pleats, a forearm pocket, and two internal dump pockets—one with an integrated security pocket", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009168/lt-tanager/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable", "구조: Exceptionally durable 3L GORE-TEX® PRO ePE with a recycled nylon face delivers waterproof, windproof, breathable protection and is free from intentionally added PFAS—all without adding a lot of weight", "밑단 및 소매 구성: 장갑 친화적인 벨크로 커프 조절 장치로 소매를 고정합니다.", "디자인 및 핏: 레귤러 핏으로 최적의 통기성과 편안함과 이동성을 보장합니다.", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "밑단 구성: Drawstring hem adjusters seal out drafts", "후드 구성: Helmet compatible StormHood™ provides full coverage without impacting visibility · High-vis orange panel on the hood is easily identifiable from the ground or air", "통합된 기능: Loops at each side of the neck secure a microphone", "패터닝: 이동성과 편안함을 위한 스노우스포츠 전용 연결 패턴", "포켓 구성: Left chest pocket is sized to be radio compatible · Maximized storage includes oversized chest pockets with volume pleats, a forearm pocket, and two internal dump pockets—one with an integrated security pocket", "스노우스포츠 기능: RECCO® 반사경은 긴급 상황에서 수색 및 구조를 지원합니다.", "지속 가능성: Shell - bluepass Material, dope dyed backer, recycled content · Dope dyed backer · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: 쉬운 통풍을 위한 구덩이 지퍼", "소재: Body: 100d 3L GORE-TEX® PRO ePE, 131 gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane 100% Nylon Backing · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: CANADA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash medium · Tumble dry normal medium · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Do not leave wet · Remove immediately", "핏: Regular"],
