    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Sonii Utility Vest", "bodyKo": "This hardworking utility vest is strategically designed to comfortably carry all your essentials for day treks and front-country adventures. Built with six easy-access pockets and a pass-through tunnel to store an extra layer, the Sonii does the work of a daypack, while breathable softshell fabric protects you from light rain and unexpected gusty weather.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010266/habitat/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Relaxed", "bodyKo": "This fit is cut loosely through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Relaxed without sacrificing structure and clean lines, it offers comfort and freedom of movement with a more casual look.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010266/habitat/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Weather resistant · Breathable · Wind resistant · Versatile", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010266/habitat/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Breathable, wind-resistant softshell fabric offers light weather protection", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010266/habitat/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Cropped length design · Relaxed fit for comfort and easy layering · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 24\"/62cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010266/habitat/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Two hand pockets with zippers · Two chest pockets · Two drop in exterior pockets · Back pass-through tunnel for storing extra layers comfortably · Easy-access pockets for pack-like storage on hikes", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010266/habitat/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Shell - bluepass Material, recycled content · Contrast - bluepass Material, recycled content · Lining - bluepass Material · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010266/habitat/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지퍼 및 플라이 구성", "bodyKo": "앞면 지퍼 여밈", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010266/black/1.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Lining: Warp knit mesh - 100% Polyester · Contrast: Terratex™ - 50D Recycled nylon/spandex plain weave, FC0 DWR, 126gsm - 95% Nylon, 5% Elastane · Body: Fortius DW 2.0 - Woven Double Weave, 186gsm - 88% Nylon, 12% Elastane · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010266/black/2.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "관리 방법", "bodyKo": "Machine wash low · Tumble dry normal low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Iron low · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse · Remove immediately", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010266/black/3.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "핏", "bodyKo": "Relaxed", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010266/black/4.jpg"}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Relaxed: This fit is cut loosely through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Relaxed without sacrificing structure and clean lines, it offers comfort and freedom of movement with a more casual look.", "기술적 특징: Weather resistant · Breathable · Wind resistant · Versatile", "구조: Breathable, wind-resistant softshell fabric offers light weather protection", "디자인 및 핏: Cropped length design · Relaxed fit for comfort and easy layering · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 24\"/62cm - Varies by size", "포켓 구성: Two hand pockets with zippers · Two chest pockets · Two drop in exterior pockets · Back pass-through tunnel for storing extra layers comfortably · Easy-access pockets for pack-like storage on hikes", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Shell - bluepass Material, recycled content · Contrast - bluepass Material, recycled content · Lining - bluepass Material · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: 앞면 지퍼 여밈", "소재: Lining: Warp knit mesh - 100% Polyester · Contrast: Terratex™ - 50D Recycled nylon/spandex plain weave, FC0 DWR, 126gsm - 95% Nylon, 5% Elastane · Body: Fortius DW 2.0 - Woven Double Weave, 186gsm - 88% Nylon, 12% Elastane · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash low · Tumble dry normal low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Iron low · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse · Remove immediately", "핏: Relaxed"],
