    sourceUrl: "https://arcteryx.com/gb/en/shop/womens/soria-tank",
    registeredAt: "2026-07-31T17:43:48.000Z",
    editTier: "bestseller",
    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Soria Tank", "bodyKo": "Trail runs, long hikes, rugged approaches to the crags - outside is where adventure lives. Streamlined and made to move, the Soria’s your tank for moving through the mountains. Comfortable and treated to wick moisture and resist odour, its nylon knit has great stretch for a secure, supportive fit, and freedom to move. The seam construction improves comfort and eliminates bulk, and the ergonomic patterning works with the stretch to elevate mobility. Crafted at a Fair Trade Certified™ facility as part of our commitment to transition 80% of Arc’teryx products to Fair Trade Certified by 2025.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000006482/black-white/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Moisture-wicking · Durable · Versatile", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000006482/black-white/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Merrow stitch seam construction reduces seam size and irritation · High elastane content utilizes black lycra for great stretch and recovery with minimal show-through · Smooth, durable nylon knit combines comfort with durability", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000006482/black-white/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Cropped length design · Trim fit with articulated patterning for mobility and freedom", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000006482/black-white/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "DAO™ 마감(내구성 있는 냄새 방지)", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000006482/black-white/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "로고 및 라벨 구성", "bodyKo": "Arc'teryx bird logo on centre back", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000006482/black-white/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "네크라인 구성", "bodyKo": "스쿱형 네크라인", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000006482/pineberry/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · This article was treated with an anti-odour biocidal product (Silvadur™ ) · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000006482/pineberry/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Self: Chira™ - 6.5oz (220gsm) stretch nylon interlock - 71% nylon, 29% elastane - bluesign Approved Material · French Regulation: AGEC Law - Article 13 · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000006482/pineberry/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "관리 방법", "bodyKo": "Machine wash gentle low · Tumble dry gentle low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener · Remove immediately · Wash inside out", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000006482/pineberry/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "핏", "bodyKo": "슬림 핏", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000006482/pineberry/5.jpg"}],
    featuresKo: ["기술적 특징: Moisture-wicking · Durable · Versatile", "구조: Merrow stitch seam construction reduces seam size and irritation · High elastane content utilizes black lycra for great stretch and recovery with minimal show-through · Smooth, durable nylon knit combines comfort with durability", "디자인 및 핏: Cropped length design · Trim fit with articulated patterning for mobility and freedom", "원단 처리: DAO™ 마감(내구성 있는 냄새 방지)", "로고 및 라벨 구성: Arc'teryx bird logo on centre back", "네크라인 구성: 스쿱형 네크라인", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · This article was treated with an anti-odour biocidal product (Silvadur™ ) · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "소재: Self: Chira™ - 6.5oz (220gsm) stretch nylon interlock - 71% nylon, 29% elastane - bluesign Approved Material · French Regulation: AGEC Law - Article 13 · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash gentle low · Tumble dry gentle low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener · Remove immediately · Wash inside out", "핏: 슬림 핏"],
