    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Andessa Down Jacket", "bodyKo": "With lofty goose down insulation and PFAS-free GORE-TEX wind and weather protection, the Andessa keeps you warm and dry when conditions get harsh. Its shorter length delivers freedom of movement and easy layering with a clean look, and the construction eliminates cold spots. An insulated adjustable hood fits over your helmet, multiple pockets offer storage, and a down-insulated collar wraps the neck for next-level warmth. This product is free of intentionally added PFAS. The new ePE membrane technology is lighter and thinner, but just as strong and durable as the materials we used before. You may notice the face fabric “wetting out” slightly faster in products with ePE membranes, but rest assured this does not affect the waterproofing of the membrane itself. If you notice the fabric wetting out faster than you’d like, simply wash the jacket and dry it to remove the oil contamination and bring the DWR back to its full power.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009948/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009948/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable · Warm and comfortable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009948/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "칼라 구성", "bodyKo": "부드럽고 따뜻한 일체형 다운 단열 칼라가 목을 감싸고 외풍을 막아줍니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009948/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Down Composite Mapping™ strategically places synthetic insulation in areas where moisture may buildup and down in areas for maximum warmth · GORE C-KNIT™ backer technology is light, soft and comfortable · Stitch-free bonded baffle construction adds durability, improves GORE-TEX® integrity · 750 fill power European grey goose down provides lightweight, efficient warmth and is RDS (Responsible Down Standard) certified · PFAS-free GORE-TEX® ePE with a recycled face delivers complete waterproof, windproof, breathable protection", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009948/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Regular fit provides freedom of movement · Shorter length, but still offers coverage and warmth · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 26\"/65cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009948/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009948/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "Warm, comfortable PrimaLoft® Silver insulated hood provides full coverage, adjusts for a fine-tuned fit, fits over a helmet, and can be removed when not in use", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009948/black/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "이동성과 편안함을 위한 스노우스포츠 전용 연결 패턴", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009948/arctic-silk/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Two hand pockets with zippers · Internal zippered pocket · Internal dump pocket · Sleeve pocket for RFID pass", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009948/arctic-silk/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "스노우스포츠 기능", "bodyKo": "Detachable powder skirt · RECCO® reflector aids search and rescue in emergency situations", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009948/arctic-silk/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "RDS (Responsible Down Standard) - 100% of our down is certified to the RDS by IDFL (No.TE-99950273) · Feather - This product contains feather not exceeding that allowable by law · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant · GRS recycled content · Lining - FC0 DWR · Padding - FC0 DWR · Shell - GRS recycled content, FC0 DWR, dope dyed backer, bluepass Material", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009948/arctic-silk/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable · Warm and comfortable", "칼라 구성: 부드럽고 따뜻한 일체형 다운 단열 칼라가 목을 감싸고 외풍을 막아줍니다.", "구조: Down Composite Mapping™ strategically places synthetic insulation in areas where moisture may buildup and down in areas for maximum warmth · GORE C-KNIT™ backer technology is light, soft and comfortable · Stitch-free bonded baffle construction adds durability, improves GORE-TEX® integrity · 750 fill power European grey goose down provides lightweight, efficient warmth and is RDS (Responsible Down Standard) certified · PFAS-free GORE-TEX® ePE with a recycled face delivers complete waterproof, windproof, breathable protection", "디자인 및 핏: Regular fit provides freedom of movement · Shorter length, but still offers coverage and warmth · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 26\"/65cm - Varies by size", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "후드 구성: Warm, comfortable PrimaLoft® Silver insulated hood provides full coverage, adjusts for a fine-tuned fit, fits over a helmet, and can be removed when not in use", "패터닝: 이동성과 편안함을 위한 스노우스포츠 전용 연결 패턴", "포켓 구성: Two hand pockets with zippers · Internal zippered pocket · Internal dump pocket · Sleeve pocket for RFID pass", "스노우스포츠 기능: Detachable powder skirt · RECCO® reflector aids search and rescue in emergency situations", "지속 가능성: RDS (Responsible Down Standard) - 100% of our down is certified to the RDS by IDFL (No.TE-99950273) · Feather - This product contains feather not exceeding that allowable by law · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant · GRS recycled content · Lining - FC0 DWR · Padding - FC0 DWR · Shell - GRS recycled content, FC0 DWR, dope dyed backer, bluepass Material", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: Pit zippers with PowderGuard™ mesh backing, for easy venting without snow entry", "소재: Down Insulation: 750 fill European grey goose down - 100% Grey Goose Down (minimum 90% down) · Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™ Continuous, 91.5gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Polyester · Lining: 20dx20d nylon ripstop w/DWR, 45gsm - 100% Nylon · Body: 80d 3L GORE-TEX® ePE with C-KNIT™ backer, plain weave recycled nylon, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash low · Tumble dry low with tennis balls · Tumble dry permanent press low · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Front load washer recommended · Use mesh bag for top load washer", "핏: Regular"],
