    sku: "X000010512",
    sourceUrl: "https://arcteryx.com/gb/en/shop/womens/beta-insulated-jacket-0512",
    registeredAt: "2026-07-31T17:43:53.000Z",
    editTier: "bestseller",
    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Beta Insulated Jacket", "bodyKo": "Our Beta all-mountain shells are renowned for versatility, durability, and willingness to take on anything. Leveraging Coreloft Continuous insulation and a PFAS-free waterproof, breathable 40D GORE-TEX ePE fabric, the Beta Insulated Jacket is the choice for mountain adventure in cold, wet conditions. Its helmet-compatible StormHood adjusts to maximize peripheral vision, pit zippers ventilate, pockets are organized and accessible, and an embedded RECCO reflector can facilitate search and rescue. This product is free of intentionally added PFAS. The new ePE membrane technology is lighter and thinner, but just as strong and durable as the materials we used before. You may notice the face fabric “wetting out” slightly faster in products with ePE membranes, but rest assured this does not affect the waterproofing of the membrane itself. If you notice the fabric wetting out faster than you’d like, simply wash the jacket and dry it to remove the oil contamination and bring the DWR back to its full power.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010512/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010512/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010512/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Breathable 20d plain weave Toray liner allows airflow and is made with recycled content · PFAS-free GORE-TEX® ePE with a recycled face delivers complete waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · GORE-TEX® fabric’s face is made with recycled content · Mapped Coreloft™ insulations are breathable and warm, perform if wet, and deliver loft retention that resists packing out so performance lasts over time", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010512/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Regular fit provides freedom of movement with room for layers · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 28\"/72cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010512/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010512/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010512/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "Adjustable low profile StormHood™ · Helmet compatible", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010512/black/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010512/vitality/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Chest pocket · Two internal dump pockets", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010512/vitality/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "스노우스포츠 기능", "bodyKo": "RECCO® 반사경은 긴급 상황에서 수색 및 구조를 지원합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010512/vitality/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지퍼 및 플라이 구성", "bodyKo": "Pit zippers for easy venting · Two-way front zipper", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010512/vitality/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable", "구조: Breathable 20d plain weave Toray liner allows airflow and is made with recycled content · PFAS-free GORE-TEX® ePE with a recycled face delivers complete waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · GORE-TEX® fabric’s face is made with recycled content · Mapped Coreloft™ insulations are breathable and warm, perform if wet, and deliver loft retention that resists packing out so performance lasts over time", "디자인 및 핏: Regular fit provides freedom of movement with room for layers · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 28\"/72cm - Varies by size", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "밑단 구성: 조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "후드 구성: Adjustable low profile StormHood™ · Helmet compatible", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "포켓 구성: Chest pocket · Two internal dump pockets", "스노우스포츠 기능: RECCO® 반사경은 긴급 상황에서 수색 및 구조를 지원합니다.", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: Pit zippers for easy venting · Two-way front zipper", "소재: Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™ Continuous, 101.7gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Polyester · Lining: 20d recycled nylon plain weave, 42gsm - 100% Nylon · Body: 40D x 70D 2L GORE-TEX® ePE, Recycled Nylon Plain Weave, 77gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash low · Tumble dry permanent press low · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Front load washer recommended · Use mesh bag for top load washer", "핏: Regular"],
