    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Squamish Jacket", "bodyKo": "A longtime favourite of mountain athletes everywhere, the Squamish Jacket is the go-to windshell whether you’re climbing El Cap or hiking in the Dolomites. The hoodless style offers ultralight, breathable coverage from strong gusts and light rain and, when the sun comes back out, the streamlined, fitted design stuffs easily into its own chest pocket so it won’t eat up precious space in your pack.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010269/pineberry/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏: 슬림 핏", "bodyKo": "Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010269/pineberry/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Breathable · Lightweight · Versatile · Packable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010269/pineberry/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Light, soft Tyono™ 30 stretch nylon ripstop fabric balances wind protection and breathability", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010269/pineberry/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "신축성 있는 커프스", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010269/pineberry/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Fitted, with articulated patterning for mobility and comfort · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 26\"/65cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010269/pineberry/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "DWR(내구성 발수) 마감으로 습기를 차단합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010269/pineberry/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "듀얼 하단 밑단 조절 장치", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010269/pineberry/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Chest pocket with zip · Harness friendly zippered hand pockets · Stows into its chest pocket and clips to carabiner for compact transport", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010269/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "PFAS(퍼- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010269/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지퍼 및 플라이 구성", "bodyKo": "No Slip Zip™ front zipper", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010269/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Body: Tyono™ 30 - Nylon Mini-Rip Lightweight Mechanical Stretch, FC0 DWR, 51gsm - 100% Nylon · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010269/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["핏: 슬림 핏: Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "기술적 특징: Breathable · Lightweight · Versatile · Packable", "구조: Light, soft Tyono™ 30 stretch nylon ripstop fabric balances wind protection and breathability", "밑단 및 소매 구성: 신축성 있는 커프스", "디자인 및 핏: Fitted, with articulated patterning for mobility and comfort · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 26\"/65cm - Varies by size", "원단 처리: DWR(내구성 발수) 마감으로 습기를 차단합니다.", "밑단 구성: 듀얼 하단 밑단 조절 장치", "포켓 구성: Chest pocket with zip · Harness friendly zippered hand pockets · Stows into its chest pocket and clips to carabiner for compact transport", "지속 가능성: PFAS(퍼- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: No Slip Zip™ front zipper", "소재: Body: Tyono™ 30 - Nylon Mini-Rip Lightweight Mechanical Stretch, FC0 DWR, 51gsm - 100% Nylon · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash low · Tumble dry normal low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse", "핏: 슬림 핏"],
