    registeredAt: "2026-07-31T17:43:55.000Z",
    editTier: "bestseller",
    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Proton SL Hoody", "bodyKo": "Insulation 컬렉션 중 가장 가볍고 통기성이 뛰어난 옵션인 Proton SL Hoody는 추운 오르막길에서의 워밍업과 시원한 조건에서의 기타 고출력 활동에 대한 추측을 없애줍니다. 니트 insulation는 배낭 바닥에 얼마나 자주 넣어도 로프트와 모양을 유지합니다. 더 중요한 것은 몸이 숨을 쉴 수 있게 해주기 때문에 크럭스를 통과하기 위해 가스를 밟아야 할 때 땀에 젖어 엉망이 되는 일이 없다는 것입니다. 업데이트된 내용: 재활용 Fortius™ 원단으로 업데이트되어 내구성이 향상되었으며 가슴 포켓과 Proton 컬렉션에 어울리는 디자인 라인이 적용되었습니다. 더 무거운 옵션이 필요하십니까? Proton 후디를 사용해 보세요.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009508/dk-stratus/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏: 슬림 핏", "bodyKo": "Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009508/dk-stratus/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Moisture-resistant outer face fabric · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009508/dk-stratus/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Fortius™ Air 20 face fabric effectively balances air permeability and weather resistance with lightweight durability and stretch · Octa® Loft breathable insulation provides thermal protection", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009508/dk-stratus/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Fitted, with articulated patterning for mobility and comfort · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 27\"/68cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009508/dk-stratus/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009508/dk-stratus/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "Helmet compatible · Adjustable insulated hood", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009508/dk-stratus/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Two zippered hand warmer pockets · Single stretch woven zippered chest pocket", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009508/dk-stratus/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009508/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Lining: Polyester Octa Rachel knit Insulation, 98gsm - 100% Polyester · Body: Fortius™ Air 20 - Plain Weave, FC0 DWR, 58gsm - 88% Nylon, 12% Elastane · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: BANGLADESH · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009508/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "관리 방법", "bodyKo": "Machine wash gentle low · Tumble dry gentle low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009508/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏", "bodyKo": "슬림 핏", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009508/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["핏: 슬림 핏: Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "기술적 특징: Moisture-resistant outer face fabric · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable", "구조: Fortius™ Air 20 face fabric effectively balances air permeability and weather resistance with lightweight durability and stretch · Octa® Loft breathable insulation provides thermal protection", "디자인 및 핏: Fitted, with articulated patterning for mobility and comfort · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 27\"/68cm - Varies by size", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "후드 구성: Helmet compatible · Adjustable insulated hood", "포켓 구성: Two zippered hand warmer pockets · Single stretch woven zippered chest pocket", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "소재: Lining: Polyester Octa Rachel knit Insulation, 98gsm - 100% Polyester · Body: Fortius™ Air 20 - Plain Weave, FC0 DWR, 58gsm - 88% Nylon, 12% Elastane · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: BANGLADESH · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash gentle low · Tumble dry gentle low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse", "핏: 슬림 핏"],
