    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Gamma MX Hoody", "bodyKo": "For the days where you need a little extra warmth but not a fully insulated layer, and a little extra weather protection but not a fully waterproof jacket — the Gamma MX Hoody has you covered. More breathable than a hardshell, this softshell offers excellent warmth for little weight and just-enough weather resistance for mixed conditions and colder days. Wear it as a standalone on chilly hikes and approaches, or as a midlayer on cold, wet-weather treks. What's been updated: Updated with FC0 material for a lower footprint.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009456/arctic-silk/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009456/arctic-silk/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Weather resistant · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009456/arctic-silk/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Hardwearing Fortius™ 2.0 softshell fabric has increased warmth to weight ratio and durability, with wind resistance and a DWR finish · Taped seams for weather resistance, a low-profile finish, and added strength", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009456/arctic-silk/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "신축성 있는 커프스", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009456/arctic-silk/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 26\"/66cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009456/arctic-silk/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009456/arctic-silk/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009456/arctic-silk/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "헬멧과 호환되는 StormHood™는 가시성에 영향을 주지 않고 완전한 커버리지를 제공합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009456/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009456/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Chest pocket with zip · Two hand pockets with hidden zippers", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009456/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Body - bluepass Material · Lining - bluepass Material, recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009456/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "기술적 특징: Weather resistant · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable", "구조: Hardwearing Fortius™ 2.0 softshell fabric has increased warmth to weight ratio and durability, with wind resistance and a DWR finish · Taped seams for weather resistance, a low-profile finish, and added strength", "밑단 및 소매 구성: 신축성 있는 커프스", "디자인 및 핏: Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 26\"/66cm - Varies by size", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "밑단 구성: 조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "후드 구성: 헬멧과 호환되는 StormHood™는 가시성에 영향을 주지 않고 완전한 커버리지를 제공합니다.", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "포켓 구성: Chest pocket with zip · Two hand pockets with hidden zippers", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Body - bluepass Material · Lining - bluepass Material, recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "소재: Lining: Recycled Polyester Brushed Pocket Mesh, 158gsm - 100% Recycled Polyester · Body: Fortius™ 2.0 - 60D Synthetic Stretch Softshell with poly fleece backer, 233gsm, FC0 DWR - 84% Nylon, 16% Elastane 100% Polyester Backing · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash gentle low · Tumble dry permanent press low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Iron low · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse", "핏: Regular"],
