    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "기술적 특징: Breathable · Lightweight · Durable", "구조: Dynamically placed shoulder seams improve freedom of movement and are comfortable under pack straps · Light, durable recycled polyester double weave is breathable and stretchy", "디자인 및 핏: 레귤러핏으로 자유로운 움직임 제공", "밑단 구성: Side slits allow ease of movement", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "포켓 구성: Two side entry chest pockets with concealed zippers", "지속 가능성: Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "UPF 등급: UPF 50+, EN 13758-2, AS4399:2020, GB/T 18830-2009. 덮힌 부분만 보호됩니다. 사용하거나 늘어나거나 젖으면 보호 기능이 저하될 수 있습니다.", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: Snap front placket for easy on-and-off", "소재: Body: Recycled polyester plain weave w/mech stretch, 92gsm, UPF 40, wrinkle finish - 100% Polyester · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash gentle low · Tumble dry normal low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Iron low · Do not use fabric softener", "핏: Regular"],
