    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Focal Hoody", "bodyKo": "Focused lines, transitional weather protection, freedom of movement, versatile aesthetic – the Focal carries you across the city’s variable conditions and varied environments. Offering stretch, durability, drape, and comfort, the Fortius™ 2.0 softshell is made from recycled nylon. Attention to detail is shown in the clean finishes: exposed metallic front zipper, taped seams, hidden pocket zippers. The adjustable hood extends coverage. Articulated patterning removes restriction and frees you to move.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010623/dark-cocoon/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010623/dark-cocoon/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Breathable · Durable · Wind resistant · Water repellent · Weather protective", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010623/dark-cocoon/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Taped seams for smoother finish · Fortius™ 2.0 stretch softshell fabric resists wind and repels water, and is made with recycled nylon", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010623/dark-cocoon/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "Adjustable cuffs with low profile snaps", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010623/dark-cocoon/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Regular fit provides freedom of movement with room for layers · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 20\"/52cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010623/dark-cocoon/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0-DWR(내구성 발수) 마감이 습기를 효과적으로 막아줍니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010623/dark-cocoon/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "Adjustable hood provides custom protection", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010623/dark-cocoon/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010623/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Two hand pockets with hidden zippers · Internal zippered pocket", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010623/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010623/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지퍼 및 플라이 구성", "bodyKo": "Exposed Excella® metal zipper with storm flap for a distinctive look", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010623/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "기술적 특징: Breathable · Durable · Wind resistant · Water repellent · Weather protective", "구조: Taped seams for smoother finish · Fortius™ 2.0 stretch softshell fabric resists wind and repels water, and is made with recycled nylon", "밑단 및 소매 구성: Adjustable cuffs with low profile snaps", "디자인 및 핏: Regular fit provides freedom of movement with room for layers · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 20\"/52cm - Varies by size", "원단 처리: FC0-DWR(내구성 발수) 마감이 습기를 효과적으로 막아줍니다.", "후드 구성: Adjustable hood provides custom protection", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "포켓 구성: Two hand pockets with hidden zippers · Internal zippered pocket", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: Exposed Excella® metal zipper with storm flap for a distinctive look", "소재: Lining: Recycled nylon/spandex plain weave with FC0 DWR, 126 gsm - 95% Nylon, 5% Elastane · Body: Fortius DW 2.0 - Woven Double Weave, 186gsm - 88% Nylon, 12% Elastane · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: 저온 기계 세탁 · 저온 일반 텀블 건조 · 표백 금지 · 어두운 색상은 분리 세탁 · 드라이클리닝 금지 · 저온 다림질 · 섬유유연제 사용 금지 · 2회 헹굼", "핏: Regular"],
