    editTier: "bestseller",
    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Satoro Merino Wool Crew Neck LS", "bodyKo": "긴 오지 트레킹과 투어, 트레일이나 눈 위의 하루 등 베이스 레이어입니다. 240gsm 메리노 울 섬유는 온도 조절, 부드러움, 자연적인 냄새 방지를 위해 선택되었습니다. 간편한 레이어링을 위해 핏이 유선형이고, 솔기를 최소화하여 자극을 줄이며, 관절형 패턴이 자유로운 움직임을 제공합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008474/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏: 슬림 핏", "bodyKo": "Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008474/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Lightweight · Natural merino wool has anti–odour properties · Cold weather comfort · Warm and comfortable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008474/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Ultra fine Merino wool is known for soft comfort, natural temperature regulation and odour resistance · Merrow and flatlock seam constructions reduce bulk and enhance comfort · Binding at back of collar for a smooth, comfortable finish", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008474/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Fitted for efficient fabric performance, easy layering · Low-profile crew neck is comfortable under layers", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008474/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008474/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Wool is sourced from humanely raised, non-mulesed sheep · RWS (Responsible Wool Standard) - The wool in this product is 100% Responsible Wool Standard (RWS) certified by IDFL (No.TE-99950273) · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008474/tatsu/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Body: Merino Lycra Jersey, 18.5mn, 240gsm - 95% Wool, 5% Elastane · Origin of fabric: NEW ZEALAND · Origin of dyeing: NEW ZEALAND", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008474/tatsu/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "관리 방법", "bodyKo": "Machine wash gentle medium · Tumble dry normal low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Iron low · Do not use fabric softener · Use wool detergent · Remove immediately · Do not wring", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008474/tatsu/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏", "bodyKo": "슬림 핏", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008474/tatsu/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["핏: 슬림 핏: Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "기술적 특징: Lightweight · Natural merino wool has anti–odour properties · Cold weather comfort · Warm and comfortable", "구조: Ultra fine Merino wool is known for soft comfort, natural temperature regulation and odour resistance · Merrow and flatlock seam constructions reduce bulk and enhance comfort · Binding at back of collar for a smooth, comfortable finish", "디자인 및 핏: Fitted for efficient fabric performance, easy layering · Low-profile crew neck is comfortable under layers", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "지속 가능성: Wool is sourced from humanely raised, non-mulesed sheep · RWS (Responsible Wool Standard) - The wool in this product is 100% Responsible Wool Standard (RWS) certified by IDFL (No.TE-99950273) · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "소재: Body: Merino Lycra Jersey, 18.5mn, 240gsm - 95% Wool, 5% Elastane · Origin of fabric: NEW ZEALAND · Origin of dyeing: NEW ZEALAND", "관리 방법: Machine wash gentle medium · Tumble dry normal low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Iron low · Do not use fabric softener · Use wool detergent · Remove immediately · Do not wring", "핏: 슬림 핏"],
