    descriptionKo: "지속적인 산악 활동을 위한 최대의 내구성과 내후성 보호.",
    image: "/products/axa-pdp/X000009990/black/1.jpg",
    images: ["/products/axa-pdp/X000009990/black/1.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009990/black/2.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009990/black/3.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009990/black/4.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009990/black/5.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009990/black/6.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009990/black/7.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009990/black/8.jpg"],
