    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Ifora Jacket", "bodyKo": "A structured, oversized silhouette made with modern performance fabrics for the range of city environments and conditions. The breathable yet wind and waterproof fabric provide essential weather protection. What's been updated: Updated with a FC0 DWR finish and PFAS-free GORE-TEX ePE laminate for a lower footprint. This product is free of intentionally added PFAS. The new ePE membrane technology is lighter and thinner, but just as strong and durable as the materials we used before. You may notice the face fabric “wetting out” slightly faster in products with ePE membranes, but rest assured this does not affect the waterproofing of the membrane itself. If you notice the fabric wetting out faster than you’d like, simply wash the jacket and dry it to remove the oil contamination and bring the DWR back to its full power.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009524/dark-cocoon/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Oversized", "bodyKo": "Our most generous fit is cut loosely throughout the entire body. Dropped shoulders and wide sleeves provide freedom of movement while offering drape and structure for a contemporary look.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009524/dark-cocoon/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009524/dark-cocoon/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Micro-seam allowance (1.6 mm) reduces bulk and weight · PFAS-free GORE-TEX® ePE with a recycled face delivers complete waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · Recycled GORE C-KNIT™ backer is quiet, soft next-to-skin, and highly breathable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009524/dark-cocoon/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "커프 개스킷으로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009524/dark-cocoon/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 28\"/72cm - Varies by size · Trench-inspired vent at back improves breathability and is protected with a storm flap and air-permeable TerraTex™ panel", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009524/dark-cocoon/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009524/dark-cocoon/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "조정 가능하고 포니테일 호환 Veilance StormHood™는 주변 시야에 영향을 주지 않고 완전한 커버리지를 제공합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009524/dark-cocoon/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009524/celestia/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "이중 입구 외부 유틸리티 포켓", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009524/celestia/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Dope dyed backer · Dope dyed uses significantly less water and energy in the dyeing process · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009524/celestia/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지퍼 및 플라이 구성", "bodyKo": "안전한 잠금과 깔끔한 ​​마감을 위한 숨겨진 전면 지퍼와 스냅 플래킷", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009524/celestia/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Oversized: Our most generous fit is cut loosely throughout the entire body. Dropped shoulders and wide sleeves provide freedom of movement while offering drape and structure for a contemporary look.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable", "구조: Micro-seam allowance (1.6 mm) reduces bulk and weight · PFAS-free GORE-TEX® ePE with a recycled face delivers complete waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · Recycled GORE C-KNIT™ backer is quiet, soft next-to-skin, and highly breathable", "밑단 및 소매 구성: 커프 개스킷으로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "디자인 및 핏: Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 28\"/72cm - Varies by size · Trench-inspired vent at back improves breathability and is protected with a storm flap and air-permeable TerraTex™ panel", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "후드 구성: 조정 가능하고 포니테일 호환 Veilance StormHood™는 주변 시야에 영향을 주지 않고 완전한 커버리지를 제공합니다.", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "포켓 구성: 이중 입구 외부 유틸리티 포켓", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Dope dyed backer · Dope dyed uses significantly less water and energy in the dyeing process · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: 안전한 잠금과 깔끔한 ​​마감을 위한 숨겨진 전면 지퍼와 스냅 플래킷", "소재: Body: 80d 3L GORE-TEX® ePE with C-KNIT™ backer, plain weave recycled nylon, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash medium · Tumble dry normal medium · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Do not leave wet · Remove immediately", "핏: Oversized"],
