    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Naya Cropped Jacket", "bodyKo": "비와 바람이 부는 조건을 견딜 수 있도록 제작된 이 가벼운 GORE-TEX ePE 쉘의 피부 바로 옆 지지대는 가장 끈끈한 여름 폭풍우 속에서도 통기성이 뛰어납니다. Naya의 세련된 디자인 라인은 크롭 길이와 결합되어 업데이트된 핏으로 하이킹에 적합한 기술적인 쉘을 제공합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010327/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010327/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010327/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "GORE C-KNIT™ backer technology is light, soft and comfortable · GORE-TEX® ePE delivers waterproof, windproof, breathable weather protection without intentionally added PFAS · Shell fabric contains 57% recycled nylon", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010327/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Cropped length design · Regular fit provides freedom of movement · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 21\"/54cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010327/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "밑단 신칭 시스템", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010327/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "조정 가능한 드롭 후드는 후드를 사용하지 않을 때 목을 덮어줍니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010327/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "숨겨진 지퍼가 달린 핸드 포켓 2개", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010327/black/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Dope dyed backer · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010327/pineberry-black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Body: 40dx70d 3L GORE-TEX® ePE with C-KNIT™ backer, plain weave recycled nylon, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010327/pineberry-black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "관리 방법", "bodyKo": "Machine wash medium · Tumble dry normal medium · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Do not leave wet · Remove immediately", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010327/pineberry-black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏", "bodyKo": "Regular", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010327/pineberry-black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable", "구조: GORE C-KNIT™ backer technology is light, soft and comfortable · GORE-TEX® ePE delivers waterproof, windproof, breathable weather protection without intentionally added PFAS · Shell fabric contains 57% recycled nylon", "디자인 및 핏: Cropped length design · Regular fit provides freedom of movement · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 21\"/54cm - Varies by size", "밑단 구성: 밑단 신칭 시스템", "후드 구성: 조정 가능한 드롭 후드는 후드를 사용하지 않을 때 목을 덮어줍니다.", "포켓 구성: 숨겨진 지퍼가 달린 핸드 포켓 2개", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Dope dyed backer · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "소재: Body: 40dx70d 3L GORE-TEX® ePE with C-KNIT™ backer, plain weave recycled nylon, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash medium · Tumble dry normal medium · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Do not leave wet · Remove immediately", "핏: Regular"],
