    registeredAt: "2026-07-31T17:44:11.000Z",
    editTier: "bestseller",
    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Lana Merino Wool Crew Shirt SS", "bodyKo": "This Merino-blend tee is an essential first layer for mountain runs, climbs, and approaches all year long. Naturally great at regulating temperature and anti-bacterial, Merino wool resists pilling and odours making it an excellent (less stinky) layer for multi-day pitches and hikes. Trust us, your tent-mates will thank you. What's been updated: Updated Betaspun Merino wool combines nylon and TENCEL™ fibres for a lighter, softer, more durable yarn that regulates temperature and resists abrasion and pilling. We also gave it a new closer-to-body fit with a shorter body and straight hem.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009495/moondrop/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009495/moondrop/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Moisture-wicking · Breathable · Lightweight", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009495/moondrop/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Ultra fine Merino wool is known for soft comfort, natural temperature regulation and odour resistance · Betaspun technology combines fibres to create a light, soft, more durable yarn that regulates temperature and elevates resistance to abrasion and pilling · Plant-derived TENCEL™ fibres provide exceptional softness and breathability · Dynamically placed shoulder seams improve freedom of movement and are comfortable under pack straps · Nylon fibres add durability", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009495/moondrop/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "레귤러핏으로 자유로운 움직임 제공", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009495/moondrop/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009495/moondrop/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Merino yarns meet the RWS (Responsible Wool Standard) and are sourced from humanely raised, non-mulesed sheep · RWS (Responsible Wool Standard) - The wool in this product is 100% Responsible Wool Standard (RWS) certified by IDFL (No.TE-99950273) · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009495/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Body: 17.5 microns Merino/Tencel/Recycled Nylon/Elastane circular knit single jersey, 150 gsm - 52% Wool, 28% Lyocell, 14% Nylon, 6% Elastane · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · Origin of fabric: VIETNAM · Origin of dyeing: VIETNAM", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009495/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "관리 방법", "bodyKo": "Machine wash gentle low · Tumble dry gentle low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Iron low · Do not use fabric softener · Use wool detergent · Do not leave wet · Do not wring", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009495/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏", "bodyKo": "Regular", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009495/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "기술적 특징: Moisture-wicking · Breathable · Lightweight", "구조: Ultra fine Merino wool is known for soft comfort, natural temperature regulation and odour resistance · Betaspun technology combines fibres to create a light, soft, more durable yarn that regulates temperature and elevates resistance to abrasion and pilling · Plant-derived TENCEL™ fibres provide exceptional softness and breathability · Dynamically placed shoulder seams improve freedom of movement and are comfortable under pack straps · Nylon fibres add durability", "디자인 및 핏: 레귤러핏으로 자유로운 움직임 제공", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "지속 가능성: Merino yarns meet the RWS (Responsible Wool Standard) and are sourced from humanely raised, non-mulesed sheep · RWS (Responsible Wool Standard) - The wool in this product is 100% Responsible Wool Standard (RWS) certified by IDFL (No.TE-99950273) · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "소재: Body: 17.5 microns Merino/Tencel/Recycled Nylon/Elastane circular knit single jersey, 150 gsm - 52% Wool, 28% Lyocell, 14% Nylon, 6% Elastane · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · Origin of fabric: VIETNAM · Origin of dyeing: VIETNAM", "관리 방법: Machine wash gentle low · Tumble dry gentle low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Iron low · Do not use fabric softener · Use wool detergent · Do not leave wet · Do not wring", "핏: Regular"],
