    descriptionKo: "성능을 저하시키지 않으면서 등판에 대한 효율성을 제공하는 여성용 턱받이입니다.",
    image: "/products/axa-pdp/X000009857/black/1.jpg",
    images: ["/products/axa-pdp/X000009857/black/1.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009857/black/2.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009857/black/3.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009857/black/4.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009857/black/5.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009857/black/6.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009857/black/7.jpg"],
