    registeredAt: "2026-07-31T17:44:12.000Z",
    editTier: "bestseller",
    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Rush Bib Pant", "bodyKo": "이제 더 가볍고 내구성이 더 뛰어난 GORE-TEX PRO ePE 패브릭으로 제공되는 투어링 전용 Rush 턱받이는 등반에 더욱 효율적입니다. 여성에게 꼭 맞는 핏을 위해 엉덩이와 다리 전체에 공간이 추가되었고, 무릎에 투어링 전용 관절이 있어 움직임이 최대한 자유로워졌습니다. 업트랙에서는 스위치백을 설정하고 다운에서는 느슨하게 설정하는 것이 그 어느 때보다 기분이 좋았습니다. 가슴과 허벅지에 키 클립이 달린 포켓이 있어 가장 중요한 장비를 안전하게 보관할 수 있습니다. 업데이트된 내용: 의도적으로 추가된 PFAS가 없는 GORE-TEX PRO ePE 패브릭, 상단 입구 턱받이 포켓 2개, 각 허벅지 포켓의 미디어 슬리브, 로우 프로파일 RECCO® 반사경, 향상된 이동성과 편안함을 위한 엉덩이와 다리의 넉넉한 핏, 더욱 안전한 서스펜더 부착으로 업데이트되었습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009857/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably under our regular and relaxed fit shells.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009857/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009857/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Highly breathable Dope Permeair™ 20 liner is coloured with dope dyed yarns – a process that uses considerably less resources than traditional dye processes · GORE-TEX® PRO ePE fabric free from intentionally added PFAS provides lightweight, durable, waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · Four-way-stretch recycled softshell material on the upper bib provides extended protection from snow and wind · Recycled face fabric is durable in all conditions", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009857/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Women's specific design for optimal fit and performance · Garment Inseam: Size 4-S (Short) is 30\"/76cm, Size 4-R (Regular) is 32\"/81cm, Size 4-T (Tall) is 35\"/88.5cm — Inseam varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009857/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "통합된 기능", "bodyKo": "조절 가능한 서스펜더 부착 장치는 미끄러짐을 최소화하고 완벽한 핏을 제공하도록 설계되었습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009857/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Two bib pockets with zippers · Insulated hand pockets with brushed lining", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009857/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지원군", "bodyKo": "Keprotec™ 발등 패치는 부츠, 아이젠, 스키 가장자리로 인한 손상으로부터 탁월한 보호 기능을 제공합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009857/black/1.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "스노우스포츠 기능", "bodyKo": "RECCO® 반사경은 긴급 상황에서 수색 및 구조를 지원합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009857/black/2.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Shell - bluepass Material, dope dyed backer, recycled content · Contrast - bluepass Material · Lining - bluepass Material, recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009857/black/3.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지퍼 및 플라이 구성", "bodyKo": "지퍼가 달린 허벅지 통풍구로 오르막길에서 열기를 배출할 수 있습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009857/black/4.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Lining: Recycled nylon/spandex stretch plain weave FC0 DWR, 138 gsm - 86% Nylon, 14% Elastane · Contrast: RecNylon DBL Weave Solid, 220gsm, FC0 DWR - 56% Nylon, 34% Polyester, 10% Elastane · Body: 3L GORE-TEX® Pro ePE, 80d recycled nylon, 131 gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane 100% Nylon Backing · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009857/black/5.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably under our regular and relaxed fit shells.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable", "구조: Highly breathable Dope Permeair™ 20 liner is coloured with dope dyed yarns – a process that uses considerably less resources than traditional dye processes · GORE-TEX® PRO ePE fabric free from intentionally added PFAS provides lightweight, durable, waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · Four-way-stretch recycled softshell material on the upper bib provides extended protection from snow and wind · Recycled face fabric is durable in all conditions", "디자인 및 핏: Women's specific design for optimal fit and performance · Garment Inseam: Size 4-S (Short) is 30\"/76cm, Size 4-R (Regular) is 32\"/81cm, Size 4-T (Tall) is 35\"/88.5cm — Inseam varies by size", "통합된 기능: 조절 가능한 서스펜더 부착 장치는 미끄러짐을 최소화하고 완벽한 핏을 제공하도록 설계되었습니다.", "포켓 구성: Two bib pockets with zippers · Insulated hand pockets with brushed lining", "지원군: Keprotec™ 발등 패치는 부츠, 아이젠, 스키 가장자리로 인한 손상으로부터 탁월한 보호 기능을 제공합니다.", "스노우스포츠 기능: RECCO® 반사경은 긴급 상황에서 수색 및 구조를 지원합니다.", "지속 가능성: Shell - bluepass Material, dope dyed backer, recycled content · Contrast - bluepass Material · Lining - bluepass Material, recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: 지퍼가 달린 허벅지 통풍구로 오르막길에서 열기를 배출할 수 있습니다.", "소재: Lining: Recycled nylon/spandex stretch plain weave FC0 DWR, 138 gsm - 86% Nylon, 14% Elastane · Contrast: RecNylon DBL Weave Solid, 220gsm, FC0 DWR - 56% Nylon, 34% Polyester, 10% Elastane · Body: 3L GORE-TEX® Pro ePE, 80d recycled nylon, 131 gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane 100% Nylon Backing · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash medium · Tumble dry normal medium · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Do not leave wet · Remove immediately", "핏: Regular"],
