    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Elec Insulated Jacket", "bodyKo": "Elec는 가볍고 통기성이 뛰어난 하이킹 재킷으로 일상복으로도 활용 가능합니다. Coreloft™ insulation는 젖었을 때에도 성능을 발휘하며 배낭이나 업무용 가방에 얼마나 자주 넣어도 원래대로 돌아옵니다. 바위처럼 튼튼한 외부 원단은 바람, 비, 트레일이나 일상 여행 중에 마주칠 수 있는 얼룩과 마찰에도 잘 견딥니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009512/mallow/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009512/mallow/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Moisture-resistant outer face fabric · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable · Insulated", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009512/mallow/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Resilient Coreloft™ Compact 60 insulation is breathable, warm, and light, performs if wet, and delivers loft retention that resists packing out · Light, soft Tyono™ 20 is air permeable · Breathable 20D recycled nylon liner helps regulate temperature and is soft and comfortable next to the skin", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009512/mallow/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Regular fit provides freedom of movement with room for layers · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 22\"/56cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009512/mallow/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009512/mallow/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009512/mallow/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009512/arctic-silk/1.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "지퍼가 달린 핸드 포켓 2개", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009512/arctic-silk/2.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Insulation - bluepass Material, recycled content · Lining - dope dyed some colours, recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009512/arctic-silk/3.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Body: 20dx20d nylon ripstop, FC0 DWR, 45gsm - 100% Nylon · Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™ 60 (60 g/m²) - 100% Polyester · Lining: 20D recycled dope dyed nylon ripstop, FC0 DWR, 38gsm - 100% Nylon · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: BANGLADESH · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009512/arctic-silk/4.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "관리 방법", "bodyKo": "Machine wash low · Tumble dry normal low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse · Front load washer recommended · Use mesh bag for top load washer", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009512/arctic-silk/5.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "기술적 특징: Moisture-resistant outer face fabric · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable · Insulated", "구조: Resilient Coreloft™ Compact 60 insulation is breathable, warm, and light, performs if wet, and delivers loft retention that resists packing out · Light, soft Tyono™ 20 is air permeable · Breathable 20D recycled nylon liner helps regulate temperature and is soft and comfortable next to the skin", "디자인 및 핏: Regular fit provides freedom of movement with room for layers · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 22\"/56cm - Varies by size", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "밑단 구성: 조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "포켓 구성: 지퍼가 달린 핸드 포켓 2개", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Insulation - bluepass Material, recycled content · Lining - dope dyed some colours, recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "소재: Body: 20dx20d nylon ripstop, FC0 DWR, 45gsm - 100% Nylon · Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™ 60 (60 g/m²) - 100% Polyester · Lining: 20D recycled dope dyed nylon ripstop, FC0 DWR, 38gsm - 100% Nylon · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: BANGLADESH · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash low · Tumble dry normal low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse · Front load washer recommended · Use mesh bag for top load washer", "핏: Regular"],
