    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Beta Pant", "bodyKo": "Part of what makes hikes like Tour du Mont Blanc so magical is the mystery of what’s around the bend—be it a fantastic view or sheet of rain. Luckily, the Beta Pant is here to keep you dry when you need it. The breathable, waterproof fabric allows vapor from your body to escape without letting water in. Plus, ¾-length side zips provide extra ventilation and make it easy to layer up in an unexpected storm. What's been updated: Updated with a PFAS-free GORE-TEX ePE laminate for a lower footprint. A new low-profile bonded stretch waistband with lower profile internal waist drawcord, single thigh pocket, and ¾-length side zipper deliver improved comfort and freedom of movement. An updated lower-profile hem reinforcement gives enhanced durability. This product is free of intentionally added PFAS. The new ePE membrane technology is lighter and thinner, but just as strong and durable as the materials we used before. You may notice the face fabric “wetting out” slightly faster in products with ePE membranes, but rest assured this does not affect the waterproofing of the membrane itself. If you notice the fabric wetting out faster than you’d like, simply wash the jacket and dry it to remove the oil contamination and bring the DWR back to its full power.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009468/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably under our regular and relaxed fit shells.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009468/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009468/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Chira™ nylon material inserts provide exceptional four-way stretch and breathable comfort · PFAS-free GORE-TEX® ePE with a recycled face delivers complete waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · Recycled GORE C-KNIT™ backer is quiet, soft next-to-skin, and highly breathable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009468/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "밑단의 아일릿에 쇼크코드를 연결할 수 있습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009468/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Women's specific design and fit · Regular fit provides freedom of movement with room for layers · Garment Inseam: Size 4-S (Short) is 30\"/75cm, Size 4-R (Regular) is 31\"/80cm, Size 4-T (Tall) is 35\"/88cm — Inseam varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009468/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009468/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "적층된 발등 패치가 상처와 마모를 방지합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009468/black/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009468/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "One zippered thigh pocket", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009468/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "스노우스포츠 기능", "bodyKo": "RECCO® 반사경은 긴급 상황에서 수색 및 구조를 지원합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009468/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Dope dyed backer · Dope dyed uses significantly less water and energy in the dyeing process · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009468/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably under our regular and relaxed fit shells.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable", "구조: Chira™ nylon material inserts provide exceptional four-way stretch and breathable comfort · PFAS-free GORE-TEX® ePE with a recycled face delivers complete waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · Recycled GORE C-KNIT™ backer is quiet, soft next-to-skin, and highly breathable", "밑단 및 소매 구성: 밑단의 아일릿에 쇼크코드를 연결할 수 있습니다.", "디자인 및 핏: Women's specific design and fit · Regular fit provides freedom of movement with room for layers · Garment Inseam: Size 4-S (Short) is 30\"/75cm, Size 4-R (Regular) is 31\"/80cm, Size 4-T (Tall) is 35\"/88cm — Inseam varies by size", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "밑단 구성: 적층된 발등 패치가 상처와 마모를 방지합니다.", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "포켓 구성: One zippered thigh pocket", "스노우스포츠 기능: RECCO® 반사경은 긴급 상황에서 수색 및 구조를 지원합니다.", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Dope dyed backer · Dope dyed uses significantly less water and energy in the dyeing process · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "허리 및 벨트 구성: Low profile stretch waistband · Stretch waistband that offers low bulk comfort and caters for different waist-hip ratios specific to her", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: Long ¾-length separating side zipper provides ventilation and allows easy on-and-off over shoes and boots", "소재: Body: 80d 3L GORE-TEX® ePE with C-KNIT™ backer, plain weave recycled nylon, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: INDONESIA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash medium · Tumble dry normal medium · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Do not leave wet · Remove immediately", "핏: Regular"],
