    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Atom Vest", "bodyKo": "If you want the warmth of an Atom Hoody with a wider range of motion and smaller footprint, you’re in the right place. Pull on the Atom Vest when you feel the temperature dropping on longer hikes and climbs or wear it as a midlayer under a shell for touring and wet winter objectives. The Coreloft synthetic insulation stays warm even if you run into light weather, making it a better alternative to down for high-output days year round. What's been updated: Updated with a new FC0 material; the side panels and lining are now made with a recycled material as well. A new regular fit, with a slightly lower collar, makes layering easier.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009507/dk-stratus-blk-sapphire/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009507/dk-stratus-blk-sapphire/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Moisture-resistant outer face fabric · Breathable · Lightweight · Insulated · Packable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009507/dk-stratus-blk-sapphire/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "칼라 구성", "bodyKo": "중간 높이 칼라 레이어 쉽게", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009507/dk-stratus-blk-sapphire/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Performance stretch fleece side panels give ventilation · Resilient Coreloft™ Compact 60 insulation is breathable, warm, and light, performs if wet, and delivers loft retention that resists packing out · Light, soft Tyono™ 20 is air permeable · Hybrid Mapping technology puts specific fabrics where they are most effective · Breathable 20D recycled nylon liner helps regulate temperature and is soft and comfortable next to the skin", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009507/dk-stratus-blk-sapphire/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Regular fit provides freedom of movement · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 26\"/66cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009507/dk-stratus-blk-sapphire/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009507/mallow/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "통풍을 차단하는 이중 조절 장치가 있는 튼튼한 스티치 밑단", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009507/mallow/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009507/mallow/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Two hand pockets with hidden zippers · Internal chest pocket with zip · Stows into its chest pocket and clips to carabiner for compact transport", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009507/mallow/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Shell - bluepass Material, recycled content · Contrast - recycled content · Insulation - recycled content · Lining - bluepass Material · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009507/mallow/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지퍼 및 플라이 구성", "bodyKo": "No Slip Zip™ front zipper · Custom TPU zipper pulls are easy to operate and glove-friendly", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009507/mallow/6.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "기술적 특징: Moisture-resistant outer face fabric · Breathable · Lightweight · Insulated · Packable", "칼라 구성: 중간 높이 칼라 레이어 쉽게", "구조: Performance stretch fleece side panels give ventilation · Resilient Coreloft™ Compact 60 insulation is breathable, warm, and light, performs if wet, and delivers loft retention that resists packing out · Light, soft Tyono™ 20 is air permeable · Hybrid Mapping technology puts specific fabrics where they are most effective · Breathable 20D recycled nylon liner helps regulate temperature and is soft and comfortable next to the skin", "디자인 및 핏: Regular fit provides freedom of movement · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 26\"/66cm - Varies by size", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "밑단 구성: 통풍을 차단하는 이중 조절 장치가 있는 튼튼한 스티치 밑단", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "포켓 구성: Two hand pockets with hidden zippers · Internal chest pocket with zip · Stows into its chest pocket and clips to carabiner for compact transport", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Shell - bluepass Material, recycled content · Contrast - recycled content · Insulation - recycled content · Lining - bluepass Material · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: No Slip Zip™ front zipper · Custom TPU zipper pulls are easy to operate and glove-friendly", "소재: Contrast: Circular Knit Fleece, 215 gsm, FC0 DWR - 93% Polyester, 7% Elastane · Body: 20dx20d nylon ripstop, FC0 DWR, 45gsm - 100% Nylon · Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™ 60 (60 g/m²) - 100% Polyester · Lining: 20D recycled dope dyed nylon ripstop, FC0 DWR, 38gsm - 100% Nylon · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: BANGLADESH · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash gentle low · Tumble dry gentle low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse · Do not wring", "핏: Regular"],
