    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Kyanite Jacket", "bodyKo": "Ready for anything, the highly versatile Kyanite performs as a midlayer or standalone across a range of activities. Delivering warmth, mobility, and moisture management, Polartec Power Stretch Pro allows airflow for breathable comfort and has a durable nylon face for abrasion resistance. The fabric’s brushed interior adds softness, four-way stretch combines with articulated patterning for exceptional freedom of movement, and the streamlined fit layers easily under a shell. What's been updated: Updated with a more streamlined fit for easier layering, an internal key pocket, and a design that facilitates repair.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008516/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏: 슬림 핏", "bodyKo": "Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008516/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Durable · Versatile", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008516/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Merrow and flatlock seam constructions reduce bulk and enhance comfort · Polartec® Power Stretch® Pro fleece combines a highly durable nylon face with a soft, comfortable, brushed polyester interior made with recycled content", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008516/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "Cuffs bound with durable Tanica™ stretch fabric · Raglan sleeve layers comfortably and improves freedom of movement", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008516/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Layers easily under an outer shell · Fitted, with articulated patterning for mobility and comfort · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 24\"/60cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008516/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "내구성이 뛰어난 Tanica™ 스트레치 원단으로 마감된 밑단", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008516/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Two hand pockets with laminated zippers · One mesh key pocket", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008516/moondrop/1.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Body - recycled content · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008516/moondrop/2.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Body: Polartec® Power Stretch® Pro, 248gsm - 53% Polyester, 38% Nylon, 9% Elastane · Origin of fabric: UNITED STATES · Origin of dyeing: UNITED STATES · Origin of Manufacture: EL SALVADOR · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008516/moondrop/3.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "관리 방법", "bodyKo": "Machine wash low · Line dry · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008516/moondrop/4.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏", "bodyKo": "슬림 핏", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008516/moondrop/5.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["핏: 슬림 핏: Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "기술적 특징: Durable · Versatile", "구조: Merrow and flatlock seam constructions reduce bulk and enhance comfort · Polartec® Power Stretch® Pro fleece combines a highly durable nylon face with a soft, comfortable, brushed polyester interior made with recycled content", "밑단 및 소매 구성: Cuffs bound with durable Tanica™ stretch fabric · Raglan sleeve layers comfortably and improves freedom of movement", "디자인 및 핏: Layers easily under an outer shell · Fitted, with articulated patterning for mobility and comfort · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 24\"/60cm - Varies by size", "밑단 구성: 내구성이 뛰어난 Tanica™ 스트레치 원단으로 마감된 밑단", "포켓 구성: Two hand pockets with laminated zippers · One mesh key pocket", "지속 가능성: Body - recycled content · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "소재: Body: Polartec® Power Stretch® Pro, 248gsm - 53% Polyester, 38% Nylon, 9% Elastane · Origin of fabric: UNITED STATES · Origin of dyeing: UNITED STATES · Origin of Manufacture: EL SALVADOR · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash low · Line dry · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener", "핏: 슬림 핏"],
