    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Gamma Jacket", "bodyKo": "Born to climb, then refined over time, the Gamma has evolved into our go-to all-mountain, all-season softshell jacket. Made from a light, durable double weave, it blends wind and water resistance with breathable comfort. A brushed backer adds comfort. The clean fit allows room for light layers, and performance stretch gives you freedom to move. Born in British Columbia where the mountains meet the sea, this is a proven performer built to handle a range of activities, conditions, and landscapes.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010378/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010378/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Breathable · Durable · Wind resistant · Versatile · Water repellent", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010378/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Brushed back Wee Burly™ Double Weave fabric is durable, weather resistant and comfortable next-to-skin · Brushed backer adds warmth and soft comfort", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010378/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "Partial elastic on cuff secures the fit", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010378/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Regular fit provides freedom of movement · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 24\"/60cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010378/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0-DWR(내구성 발수) 마감이 습기를 효과적으로 막아줍니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010378/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010378/alpine-rose/1.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010378/alpine-rose/2.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Chest pocket with zip · Two hand pockets", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010378/alpine-rose/3.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Shell - bluepass Material · Lining - bluepass Material · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010378/alpine-rose/4.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "UPF 등급", "bodyKo": "UPF 50+, EN 13758-2, AS4399:2020, GB/T 18830-2009. 덮힌 부분만 보호됩니다. 사용하거나 늘어나거나 젖으면 보호 기능이 저하될 수 있습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010378/alpine-rose/5.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "기술적 특징: Breathable · Durable · Wind resistant · Versatile · Water repellent", "구조: Brushed back Wee Burly™ Double Weave fabric is durable, weather resistant and comfortable next-to-skin · Brushed backer adds warmth and soft comfort", "밑단 및 소매 구성: Partial elastic on cuff secures the fit", "디자인 및 핏: Regular fit provides freedom of movement · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 24\"/60cm - Varies by size", "원단 처리: FC0-DWR(내구성 발수) 마감이 습기를 효과적으로 막아줍니다.", "밑단 구성: 조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "포켓 구성: Chest pocket with zip · Two hand pockets", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Shell - bluepass Material · Lining - bluepass Material · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "UPF 등급: UPF 50+, EN 13758-2, AS4399:2020, GB/T 18830-2009. 덮힌 부분만 보호됩니다. 사용하거나 늘어나거나 젖으면 보호 기능이 저하될 수 있습니다.", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: Full length Vislon front zip with windflap and chinguard · No Slip Zip™ front zipper", "소재: Lining: Warp knit mesh - 100% Polyester · Body: Wee Burly™ Double Weave, 220gsm, Brush Backer - 56% Nylon, 34% Polyester, 10% Elastane · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: INDONESIA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: 저온 기계 세탁 · 저온 일반 텀블 건조 · 표백 금지 · 어두운 색상은 분리 세탁 · 드라이클리닝 금지 · 저온 다림질 · 섬유유연제 사용 금지 · 2회 헹굼", "핏: Regular"],
