    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Coelle Jacket", "bodyKo": "Take rain out of the equation with this lightweight, packable shell ready for quick hikes and daily life. Its three-layer waterproof fabric allows body heat to escape without letting water in. The backer gives it added softness for comfort whether you’re running into the store, finishing your route in unexpected rain, or grabbing a bite to eat with friends after a big day on the trails. What's been updated: Updated with exposed hand pockets and no internal security pocket for a lighter construction, plus a new, more durable, PFAS-free GORE-TEX fabric. We moved the front hood cord adjusters to the inside and the RECCO® reflector to the hood for a more minimalist look and feel without sacrificing functionality.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009466/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009466/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009466/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "GORE C-KNIT™ backer technology is light, soft and comfortable · PFAS-free GORE-TEX® ePE with a recycled face delivers complete waterproof, windproof, breathable protection", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009466/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Regular fit provides freedom of movement with room for layers · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 24\"/60cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009466/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009466/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009466/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "Adjustable StormHood™ · Hood provides full coverage and uses a unique precision adjustment system to improve fit without impacting peripheral vision", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009466/black/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009466/alpine-blue/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "지퍼가 달린 핸드 포켓 2개", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009466/alpine-blue/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "스노우스포츠 기능", "bodyKo": "RECCO® 반사경은 긴급 상황에서 수색 및 구조를 지원합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009466/alpine-blue/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Dope dyed backer · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009466/alpine-blue/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable", "구조: GORE C-KNIT™ backer technology is light, soft and comfortable · PFAS-free GORE-TEX® ePE with a recycled face delivers complete waterproof, windproof, breathable protection", "디자인 및 핏: Regular fit provides freedom of movement with room for layers · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 24\"/60cm - Varies by size", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "밑단 구성: 조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "후드 구성: Adjustable StormHood™ · Hood provides full coverage and uses a unique precision adjustment system to improve fit without impacting peripheral vision", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "포켓 구성: 지퍼가 달린 핸드 포켓 2개", "스노우스포츠 기능: RECCO® 반사경은 긴급 상황에서 수색 및 구조를 지원합니다.", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Dope dyed backer · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "소재: Body: 3L ePE GORE-TEX®, 15d recycled nylon, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane 100% Nylon Backing · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash medium · Tumble dry normal medium · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Do not leave wet · Remove immediately", "핏: Regular"],
