    registeredAt: "2026-07-31T17:44:30.000Z",
    editTier: "bestseller",
    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Atom SL Hoody", "bodyKo": "원본보다 가벼운 Atom SL Hoody는 소유할 수 있는 가장 유용하고 휴대 가능한 제품 중 하나입니다. 춥고 습한 날씨를 헤쳐나가는 트레일 러닝에서는 독립형 레이어로 착용하고, 추가적인 보온성과 이동성을 요구하는 산악 활동에서는 방수 쉘과 레이어링하여 착용하세요. 통기성과 내후성이 뛰어나며 몸체에 신축성 있는 insulation가 있지만 소매나 후드는 그렇지 않습니다. 휴대성을 극대화하는 동시에 중심부에 집중된 따뜻함을 전달합니다. 업데이트된 내용: 재활용 Fortius™ Air 20 패브릭, 재활용 신축성 합성 insulation, FC0 DWR 마감으로 업데이트되어 이동성이 향상되고 설치 공간이 줄어듭니다. 새로운 Octa® Fleece 측면 패널은 통기성을 향상시키고 미세 흘림을 줄여줍니다. StormHood™는 이제 안감 처리되어 더 이상 보관할 수 없습니다. Bird 로고가 자수 처리되어 있어 시각적으로 오래도록 유지됩니다. 더 무거운 옵션이 필요하십니까? Atom 후디를 사용해 보세요.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009511/arctic-silk/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏: 슬림 핏", "bodyKo": "Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009511/arctic-silk/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Moisture-resistant outer face fabric · Breathable · Lightweight · Compressible and packable · Durable · Wind resistant · Ultralight", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009511/arctic-silk/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Fortius™ Air 20 face fabric effectively balances air permeability and weather resistance with lightweight durability and stretch · Stretch synthetic insulation is breathable, warm, and light, adds freedom of movement, and is made with recycled content · Lightweight stretch Octa® Fleece side panels provide freedom of movement and improve ventilation", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009511/arctic-silk/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "uninsulated 메쉬 안감 슬리브가 빛을 보호하고 온도를 조절합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009511/arctic-silk/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Fitted, with articulated patterning for mobility and comfort · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 26\"/65cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009511/arctic-silk/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009511/arctic-silk/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009511/arctic-silk/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "조정 가능한 로우 프로파일 uninsulated StormHood™", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009511/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "지퍼가 달린 핸드 포켓 2개", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009511/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Shell - bluepass Material · Contrast - recycled content · Insulation - recycled content · Lining - bluepass Material · This article was treated with an anti-odour biocidal product (Polygiene) · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009511/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Contrast: Octa® Polyester Fleece, 40D Delta Face, 122gsm - 100% Polyester · Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™ Stretch, 40gsm - 100% Polyester · Lining: Recycled 20d nylon plain weave weft stretch FC0 DWR, 58gsm - 88% Nylon, 12% Elastane · Body: Fortius™ Air 20 - Plain Weave, FC0 DWR, 58gsm - 88% Nylon, 12% Elastane · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: BANGLADESH · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009511/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["핏: 슬림 핏: Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "기술적 특징: Moisture-resistant outer face fabric · Breathable · Lightweight · Compressible and packable · Durable · Wind resistant · Ultralight", "구조: Fortius™ Air 20 face fabric effectively balances air permeability and weather resistance with lightweight durability and stretch · Stretch synthetic insulation is breathable, warm, and light, adds freedom of movement, and is made with recycled content · Lightweight stretch Octa® Fleece side panels provide freedom of movement and improve ventilation", "밑단 및 소매 구성: uninsulated 메쉬 안감 슬리브가 빛을 보호하고 온도를 조절합니다.", "디자인 및 핏: Fitted, with articulated patterning for mobility and comfort · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 26\"/65cm - Varies by size", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "밑단 구성: 조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "후드 구성: 조정 가능한 로우 프로파일 uninsulated StormHood™", "포켓 구성: 지퍼가 달린 핸드 포켓 2개", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Shell - bluepass Material · Contrast - recycled content · Insulation - recycled content · Lining - bluepass Material · This article was treated with an anti-odour biocidal product (Polygiene) · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "소재: Contrast: Octa® Polyester Fleece, 40D Delta Face, 122gsm - 100% Polyester · Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™ Stretch, 40gsm - 100% Polyester · Lining: Recycled 20d nylon plain weave weft stretch FC0 DWR, 58gsm - 88% Nylon, 12% Elastane · Body: Fortius™ Air 20 - Plain Weave, FC0 DWR, 58gsm - 88% Nylon, 12% Elastane · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: BANGLADESH · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash gentle low · Tumble dry gentle low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse · Do not wring", "핏: 슬림 핏"],
