    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Alpine Guide Jacket", "bodyKo": "Primarily meant for self-propelled objectives, this lightweight, durable, and packable jacket goes from high output to low output easily. With updated GORE-TEX PRO ePE fabric that is free from intentionally added PFAS and abrasion-resistant Hadron LCP (Liquid Crystal Polymer) grid face fabric, this shell can be easily stashed in your pack until the weather turns, providing fast shelter in a more lightweight package. A lower-profile removable RECCO® reflector ensures no more mixed, multiple signals in the field during rescues.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009009/fluidity/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009009/fluidity/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009009/fluidity/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "칼라 구성", "bodyKo": "Loop on the left side of the collar secures a microphone", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009009/fluidity/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Proprietary Hadron® LCP (Liquid Crystal Polymer) grid face fabric is incredibly light and exceptionally durable with abrasion resistance rivalling fabrics twice its weight · Light, highly durable, PFAS-free GORE-TEX® PRO ePE delivers waterproof, windproof, breathable protection and has a recycled nylon face fabric", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009009/fluidity/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "장갑 친화적인 벨크로 커프 조절 장치로 소매를 고정합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009009/fluidity/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "레귤러 핏으로 최적의 통기성과 편안함과 이동성을 보장합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009009/fluidity/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009009/fluidity/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "Hemlock™ prevents jacket from slipping out from under harness", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009009/blaze/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "Helmet compatible StormHood™ provides full coverage without impacting visibility · High-vis orange panel on the hood is easily identifiable from the ground or air", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009009/blaze/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Two chest pockets with zippers · Internal stretch security pocket offers storage", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009009/blaze/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "스노우스포츠 기능", "bodyKo": "RECCO® 반사경은 긴급 상황에서 수색 및 구조를 지원합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009009/blaze/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably over or under our layers.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable", "칼라 구성: Loop on the left side of the collar secures a microphone", "구조: Proprietary Hadron® LCP (Liquid Crystal Polymer) grid face fabric is incredibly light and exceptionally durable with abrasion resistance rivalling fabrics twice its weight · Light, highly durable, PFAS-free GORE-TEX® PRO ePE delivers waterproof, windproof, breathable protection and has a recycled nylon face fabric", "밑단 및 소매 구성: 장갑 친화적인 벨크로 커프 조절 장치로 소매를 고정합니다.", "디자인 및 핏: 레귤러 핏으로 최적의 통기성과 편안함과 이동성을 보장합니다.", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "밑단 구성: Hemlock™ prevents jacket from slipping out from under harness", "후드 구성: Helmet compatible StormHood™ provides full coverage without impacting visibility · High-vis orange panel on the hood is easily identifiable from the ground or air", "포켓 구성: Two chest pockets with zippers · Internal stretch security pocket offers storage", "스노우스포츠 기능: RECCO® 반사경은 긴급 상황에서 수색 및 구조를 지원합니다.", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Shell - bluepass Material, dope dyed backer, recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: 쉬운 통풍을 위한 구덩이 지퍼", "소재: Body: Hadron® with 3L 50D GORE-TEX® PRO ePE, 99 gsm, FC0 DWR - 94% Nylon, 6% Polyarylate with ePE and PU Membrane 100% Nylon Backing · Contrast: 3L GORE-TEX® PRO ePE, 150d recycled polyester high vis plain weave, 205gsm, C0 DWR - 100% Polyester with ePE and PU Membrane 100% Nylon Backing · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: CANADA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash medium · Tumble dry normal medium · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Do not leave wet · Remove immediately", "핏: Regular"],
