    registeredAt: "2026-07-31T17:44:32.000Z",
    editTier: "bestseller",
    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Sentinel Bib Pant", "bodyKo": "Powder days are bib days. Made for freeriders looking for the steep and deep, the Sentinel’s breathable GORE-TEX fabric has a durable 80D face, shuts out wind and snow, and is PFAS-free for lighter footprint. A brushed backer adds comfort. Thigh vents release heat on uptracks, RECCO technology can aid in search situations, a drop seat speeds pit stops, and the pockets are ample and organized. Articulated for the snow, the Sentinel gives you freedom to move on backcountry tours or days at the resort. What's been updated: Updated with a new GORE-TEX ePE fabric with a more durable 80D recycled face, recycled C-KNIT backer, and a PFAS-free waterproof, breathable laminate. This product is free of intentionally added PFAS. The new ePE membrane technology is lighter and thinner, but just as strong and durable as the materials we used before. You may notice the face fabric “wetting out” slightly faster in products with ePE membranes, but rest assured this does not affect the waterproofing of the membrane itself. If you notice the fabric wetting out faster than you’d like, simply wash the jacket and dry it to remove the oil contamination and bring the DWR back to its full power.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009106/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably under our regular and relaxed fit shells.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009106/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009106/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "PFAS-free GORE-TEX® ePE with a recycled face delivers complete waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · 80D ePE SSD (Soft Shell Dope Dyed) - flannel backer for added comfort", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009106/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Drop seat design · Thigh vents · Regular fit provides freedom of movement with room for layers · Full-length front bib for maximum coverage · Adjustable suspenders hold bibs up · Garment Inseam: Size 4-S (Short) is 29\"/74cm, Size 4-R (Regular) is 31\"/79cm, Size 4-T (Tall) is 34\"/86cm — Inseam varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009106/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009106/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "이동성과 편안함을 위한 스노우스포츠 전용 연결 패턴", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009106/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Two zippered thigh pockets with key loop and phone sleeve for secure, accessible storage · Vertical chest pocket", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009106/black/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지원군", "bodyKo": "Keprotec™ 발등 패치는 부츠, 아이젠, 스키 가장자리로 인한 손상으로부터 탁월한 보호 기능을 제공합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009106/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "스노우스포츠 기능", "bodyKo": "RECCO® reflector aids search and rescue in emergency situations · Durable stretch softshell PowderCuffs™ seal out snow, provide freedom of movement, and accommodate a range of boot types", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009106/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Shell - dope dyed · Shell - bluepass Material, recycled content · Lining - bluepass Material, recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009106/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Body: 3L GORE-TEX® ePE, Beam Dyed, 80d plain weave recycled nylon, 165gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane, 100% Polyester Backing · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009106/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably under our regular and relaxed fit shells.", "기술적 특징: Waterproof · Windproof · Breathable · Durable", "구조: PFAS-free GORE-TEX® ePE with a recycled face delivers complete waterproof, windproof, breathable protection · 80D ePE SSD (Soft Shell Dope Dyed) - flannel backer for added comfort", "디자인 및 핏: Drop seat design · Thigh vents · Regular fit provides freedom of movement with room for layers · Full-length front bib for maximum coverage · Adjustable suspenders hold bibs up · Garment Inseam: Size 4-S (Short) is 29\"/74cm, Size 4-R (Regular) is 31\"/79cm, Size 4-T (Tall) is 34\"/86cm — Inseam varies by size", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "패터닝: 이동성과 편안함을 위한 스노우스포츠 전용 연결 패턴", "포켓 구성: Two zippered thigh pockets with key loop and phone sleeve for secure, accessible storage · Vertical chest pocket", "지원군: Keprotec™ 발등 패치는 부츠, 아이젠, 스키 가장자리로 인한 손상으로부터 탁월한 보호 기능을 제공합니다.", "스노우스포츠 기능: RECCO® reflector aids search and rescue in emergency situations · Durable stretch softshell PowderCuffs™ seal out snow, provide freedom of movement, and accommodate a range of boot types", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Shell - dope dyed · Shell - bluepass Material, recycled content · Lining - bluepass Material, recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "소재: Body: 3L GORE-TEX® ePE, Beam Dyed, 80d plain weave recycled nylon, 165gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon with ePE and PU Membrane, 100% Polyester Backing · Origin of fabric: CHINA · Origin of dyeing: CHINA · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash medium · Tumble dry normal medium · Do not bleach · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Wash separately · Do not use fabric softener · Close all fastenings before wash · Double rinse · Do not leave wet · Remove immediately", "핏: Regular"],
