    sourceUrl: "https://arcteryx.com/gb/en/shop/womens/cerium-hoody-0554",
    registeredAt: "2026-07-31T17:44:37.000Z",
    editTier: "bestseller",
    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Cerium Hoody", "bodyKo": "The Cerium is a go-to for virtually any alpine undertaking. Taking it higher, we refined the design and sourced more sustainable materials while maintaining its exceptional warmth-to-weight ratio and packability. Responsibly-sourced 850 fill down – with Coreloft™ synthetic utilized in areas prone to moisture – provides premium insulation. The outer, recycled 15D Arato™ nylon with dope-dyed yarns, is light and durable. An insulated StormHood™ extends the warmth, and the streamlined ergonomic fit layers easily. As an alternative to down fill insulation, we also offer synthetic fill products, such as the Atom Hoody .", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010554/moondrop/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏: 슬림 핏", "bodyKo": "Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010554/moondrop/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Moisture-resistant outer face fabric · Breathable · Great warmth-to-weight ratio · Lightweight · Compressible and packable · Wind resistant · Versatile", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010554/moondrop/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Down Composite Mapping™ strategically places synthetic insulation in areas where moisture may buildup and down in areas for maximum warmth · 850 fill European white goose down for exceptional warmth-to-weight ratio · Recycled 15D Arato™ outer is light, durable, and coloured with dope dyed yarns · Downproof 20D plant-based Arato™ liner is exceptionally lightweight and reduces petroleum use", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010554/moondrop/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "신축성 있는 커프스", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010554/moondrop/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Trim fit makes it an ideal layering piece · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 24\"/62cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010554/moondrop/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0-DWR(내구성 발수) 마감이 습기를 효과적으로 막아줍니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010554/moondrop/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010554/moondrop/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "Adjustable, insulated StormHood™ · Helmet compatible · Single pull adjuster does not restrict vision", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010554/mantis/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010554/mantis/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Included mini stuff sack with drawcord closure · Two hand pockets with zippers · Zippered internal security pocket", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010554/mantis/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Shell - recycled content · Lining - bio-derived material · RDS (Responsible Down Standard) - 100% of our down is certified to the RDS by IDFL (No.TE-99950273) · Feather - This product contains feather not exceeding that allowable by law · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant · Sterilization Permit Number- PER. NO. PA-8811 (CA) · Padding - bluepass Material", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010554/mantis/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["핏: 슬림 핏: Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "기술적 특징: Moisture-resistant outer face fabric · Breathable · Great warmth-to-weight ratio · Lightweight · Compressible and packable · Wind resistant · Versatile", "구조: Down Composite Mapping™ strategically places synthetic insulation in areas where moisture may buildup and down in areas for maximum warmth · 850 fill European white goose down for exceptional warmth-to-weight ratio · Recycled 15D Arato™ outer is light, durable, and coloured with dope dyed yarns · Downproof 20D plant-based Arato™ liner is exceptionally lightweight and reduces petroleum use", "밑단 및 소매 구성: 신축성 있는 커프스", "디자인 및 핏: Trim fit makes it an ideal layering piece · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 24\"/62cm - Varies by size", "원단 처리: FC0-DWR(내구성 발수) 마감이 습기를 효과적으로 막아줍니다.", "밑단 구성: 조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "후드 구성: Adjustable, insulated StormHood™ · Helmet compatible · Single pull adjuster does not restrict vision", "패터닝: 자유로운 움직임을 위한 입체 패터닝", "포켓 구성: Included mini stuff sack with drawcord closure · Two hand pockets with zippers · Zippered internal security pocket", "지속 가능성: Shell - recycled content · Lining - bio-derived material · RDS (Responsible Down Standard) - 100% of our down is certified to the RDS by IDFL (No.TE-99950273) · Feather - This product contains feather not exceeding that allowable by law · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant · Sterilization Permit Number- PER. NO. PA-8811 (CA) · Padding - bluepass Material", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: TPU zipper-pulls reduce noise and are easy to grab · Reverse coil centre-front zipper improves durability and creates a streamlined profile", "소재: Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™ 80 (80 g/m²) - 100% Polyester · Down Insulation: 850 fill European white goose down - 100% White Goose Down (minimum 90% down) · Lining: 10D x 20D Ripstop - 100% Nylon · Body: Arato™ 15, recycled N6 microrip, jigger dyed - 100% Recycled Nylon · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash gentle low · Tumble dry gentle low · Tumble dry low with tennis balls · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse · Front load washer recommended · Use mesh bag for top load washer", "핏: 슬림 핏"],
