    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Sinsola Short 5\"", "bodyKo": "No frills, just thrills in these lightweight, rugged shorts built for multiday, high-mileage hikes where you don’t want to carry extra bulk. Strategically designed with quick-dry fabric and an A-line shape, the Sinsola won’t bind or creep while keeping air moving where you need it most.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010219/dk-stratus/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "Fit: Regular", "bodyKo": "Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably under our regular and relaxed fit shells.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010219/dk-stratus/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Moisture-wicking · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable · Water repellent", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010219/dk-stratus/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Liner-less construction keeps air circulating in high-sweat areas", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010219/dk-stratus/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "A-line design · Regular fit provides freedom of movement · Garment Inseam: Size 4 is 5\"/13cm — Inseam varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010219/dk-stratus/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Two hand pockets · Two external dump pockets", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010219/dk-stratus/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010219/pineberry/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "허리 및 벨트 구성", "bodyKo": "Adjustable elastic waistband for a secure, comfortable fit", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010219/pineberry/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Body: Fortius™ DW 1.0 - Woven Double Weave, 125gsm - 86% Nylon, 14% Elastane · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: BANGLADESH · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010219/pineberry/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "관리 방법", "bodyKo": "Machine wash low · Tumble dry normal low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Iron low · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse · Wash inside out", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010219/pineberry/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "핏", "bodyKo": "Regular", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010219/pineberry/5.jpg"}],
    featuresKo: ["Fit: Regular: Our classic fit is cut comfortably throughout the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. It allows freedom of movement, provides shape, and layers comfortably under our regular and relaxed fit shells.", "기술적 특징: Moisture-wicking · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable · Water repellent", "구조: Liner-less construction keeps air circulating in high-sweat areas", "디자인 및 핏: A-line design · Regular fit provides freedom of movement · Garment Inseam: Size 4 is 5\"/13cm — Inseam varies by size", "포켓 구성: Two hand pockets · Two external dump pockets", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "허리 및 벨트 구성: Adjustable elastic waistband for a secure, comfortable fit", "소재: Body: Fortius™ DW 1.0 - Woven Double Weave, 125gsm - 86% Nylon, 14% Elastane · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: BANGLADESH · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash low · Tumble dry normal low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Iron low · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse · Wash inside out", "핏: Regular"],
