    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Kyanite Hoody", "bodyKo": "Ski 투어, 캠프에서의 가을 아침, 쌀쌀한 날 볼더링 – 가장 따뜻한 Kyanite의 열 성능, 내구성 및 부드러운 편안함은 미드레이어 또는 독립형으로 빛을 발합니다. Polartec Power Stretch Pro는 내마모성을 위한 나일론 페이스를 갖추고 있으며 4방향 스트레치와 연결 패턴이 결합되어 탁월한 움직임의 자유를 제공합니다. 유선형 핏은 쉘 아래에 쉽게 겹쳐지며 로우 프로파일 ScubaHood는 따뜻함을 더해줍니다. 업데이트된 내용: 더욱 간편한 레이어링을 위한 더욱 유선형적인 핏, 내부 키 포켓, 수리가 용이한 디자인으로 업데이트되었습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008535/moondrop/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏: 슬림 핏", "bodyKo": "Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008535/moondrop/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Durable · Versatile", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008535/moondrop/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Merrow and flatlock seam constructions reduce bulk and enhance comfort · Polartec® Power Stretch® Pro fleece combines a highly durable nylon face with a soft, comfortable, brushed polyester interior made with recycled content", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008535/moondrop/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "Cuffs bound with durable Tanica™ stretch fabric · Raglan sleeve layers comfortably and improves freedom of movement", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008535/moondrop/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Fitted, with articulated patterning for mobility and comfort · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 26\"/65cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008535/moondrop/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "내구성이 뛰어난 Tanica™ 스트레치 원단으로 마감된 밑단", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008535/moondrop/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "아늑하고 편안한 로우 프로파일 후드가 머리를 감싸 따뜻함을 더해줍니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008535/moondrop/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Two hand pockets with laminated zippers · One mesh key pocket", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008535/dk-stratus/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Body - recycled content · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008535/dk-stratus/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Body: Polartec® Power Stretch® Pro, 248gsm - 53% Polyester, 38% Nylon, 9% Elastane · Origin of fabric: UNITED STATES · Origin of dyeing: UNITED STATES · Origin of Manufacture: EL SALVADOR · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008535/dk-stratus/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "관리 방법", "bodyKo": "Machine wash low · Line dry · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000008535/dk-stratus/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["핏: 슬림 핏: Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "기술적 특징: Durable · Versatile", "구조: Merrow and flatlock seam constructions reduce bulk and enhance comfort · Polartec® Power Stretch® Pro fleece combines a highly durable nylon face with a soft, comfortable, brushed polyester interior made with recycled content", "밑단 및 소매 구성: Cuffs bound with durable Tanica™ stretch fabric · Raglan sleeve layers comfortably and improves freedom of movement", "디자인 및 핏: Fitted, with articulated patterning for mobility and comfort · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 26\"/65cm - Varies by size", "밑단 구성: 내구성이 뛰어난 Tanica™ 스트레치 원단으로 마감된 밑단", "후드 구성: 아늑하고 편안한 로우 프로파일 후드가 머리를 감싸 따뜻함을 더해줍니다.", "포켓 구성: Two hand pockets with laminated zippers · One mesh key pocket", "지속 가능성: Body - recycled content · Recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "소재: Body: Polartec® Power Stretch® Pro, 248gsm - 53% Polyester, 38% Nylon, 9% Elastane · Origin of fabric: UNITED STATES · Origin of dyeing: UNITED STATES · Origin of Manufacture: EL SALVADOR · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash low · Line dry · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener", "핏: 슬림 핏"],
