    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Kyanite LT Hoody", "bodyKo": "Simplicity melts boundaries. Designed to provide appropriate warmth for shoulder season conditions, and refined to perform across a range of activities, the Kyanite is a lightweight technical hoody that shines as a midlayer or standalone. Providing warmth, mobility and moisture management, the Torrent™ fleece offers four-way stretch and is incredibly soft against skin. The trim fit layers easily, a low-profile ScubaHood™ adds warmth, and a No Slip Zip™ prevents inadvertent opening. Size and fit tip: Fitted fit - This trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably under our outer layers. This model's fit has evolved. Before you check out, please make sure to reference our sizing chart to determine your correct size.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009645/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏: 슬림 핏", "bodyKo": "Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009645/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Durable · Versatile", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009645/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Four-way stretch textile · Torrent™ stretch fleece is extremely soft next-to-skin, manages moisture, provides light warmth and performance stretch, is brushed for softness · Merrow stitch seam construction reduces seam size and irritation", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009645/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Trim, slim fit, optimizes exceptional breathability during high output · This model’s fit has evolved. Please reference our sizing chart to make sure it’s the right size for you · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 26\"/65cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009645/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "로우 프로파일 후드", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009645/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "패터닝", "bodyKo": "Articulated patterning for unrestricted mobility · Gusseted underarms for mobility and comfort", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009645/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "지퍼가 달린 핸드 포켓 2개", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009645/black/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Lining - bluepass Material · This article was treated with an anti-odour biocidal product (Polygiene) · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009645/reef/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지퍼 및 플라이 구성", "bodyKo": "No Slip Zip™ front zipper · Kissing Zipper chin guard protects chin and neck from zipper chafing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009645/reef/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Contrast: Warp knit mesh - 100% Polyester · Body: Torrent™ - Jersey knit peached face with brushed back, 185gsm - 84% Polyester, 16% Elastane · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009645/reef/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "관리 방법", "bodyKo": "Machine wash low · Tumble dry normal low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Iron low · Do not use fabric softener · Remove immediately · Wash inside out", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000009645/reef/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["핏: 슬림 핏: Our trimmer fit is patterned to stay close to the body through the chest, waist, hip, and thigh. Its low profile eliminates bulk, moves with the body, and fits comfortably over first layers or under outer layers.", "기술적 특징: Durable · Versatile", "구조: Four-way stretch textile · Torrent™ stretch fleece is extremely soft next-to-skin, manages moisture, provides light warmth and performance stretch, is brushed for softness · Merrow stitch seam construction reduces seam size and irritation", "디자인 및 핏: Trim, slim fit, optimizes exceptional breathability during high output · This model’s fit has evolved. Please reference our sizing chart to make sure it’s the right size for you · Garment Centre Back Length: Size S is 26\"/65cm - Varies by size", "후드 구성: 로우 프로파일 후드", "패터닝: Articulated patterning for unrestricted mobility · Gusseted underarms for mobility and comfort", "포켓 구성: 지퍼가 달린 핸드 포켓 2개", "지속 가능성: Contains materials produced through processes that meet bluesign® criteria · Lining - bluepass Material · This article was treated with an anti-odour biocidal product (Polygiene) · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: No Slip Zip™ front zipper · Kissing Zipper chin guard protects chin and neck from zipper chafing", "소재: Contrast: Warp knit mesh - 100% Polyester · Body: Torrent™ - Jersey knit peached face with brushed back, 185gsm - 84% Polyester, 16% Elastane · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리 방법: Machine wash low · Tumble dry normal low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Iron low · Do not use fabric softener · Remove immediately · Wash inside out", "핏: 슬림 핏"],
